<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yosuwe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa Masenyi Annabi Yosuwe bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yosuwe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yos</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa Masenyi Annabi Yosuwe bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayilakae xa taruxui sɛbɛxi kitaabui gbegbe nan kui. A fɔlɔma Tawureta Munsa nan ma. Isirayila kuntigie, Annabi Iburahima, Annabi Isiyaga, Annabi Yaxuba, nun a xa di fu nun firinyie, e birin xa taruxui toma Tawureta Munsa kitaabui singe nan kui, naxan xili «Fe Fɔlɔ Fɔlɛ.» Na kitaabui raɲɔnyi a masenma won bɛ Isirayilakae Misira bɔxi li ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawureta Munsa kitaabui firin nde, naxan xili «Isirayilakae xa yɛtɛ sɔtɔɛ,» a fɔlɔma Annabi Munsa xa taruxui nan ma. Ala naxa a ragiri a xa bari Misira bɔxi ma, alako a xa Isirayila ɲama ramini konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayilakae to Xulunyumi Baa igiri Ala xa kaabanakoe saabui ra, e naxa so gbengberenyi ma. Ala nu wama e xaninfe Kanaan bɔxi nan ma, a dɛnnaxɛ laayidi fife ra Isirayilakae ma. Tawureta Munsa kitaabui saxan nde, a naani nde, nun a suuli nde na biyaasi xa fe masenma. Isirayila ɲama naxa bu gbengberenyi ma ɲɛ tongo naani beenun e xa Kanaan bɔxi li. E bu naa e xa danxaniyatareɲa nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">E to keli Yurudɛn xure igiride, e xa so Kanaan bɔxi ma, Alatala naxa a masen Isirayilakae bɛ a Yosuwe xa findi e xa yarerati ra Annabi Munsa ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Annabi Yosuwe naxa e ragiri Yurudɛn xure ra Ala xa kaabanakoe ra, alɔ Annabi Munsa e ragiri xulunyumi Baa ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na dangi xanbi, Yosuwe naxa e xun ti Kanaan bɔxi ra, e xa gere so alako e xa na bɔxi sɔtɔ. Ala nu wama na fife e ma a xa xanunteya nun a xa saatɛ nan ma fe ra. Na kui, a naxa e mali na geree kui, han Kanaankae birin naxa gaaxu e ya ra. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firinyi birin naxa e gbe bɔxi sɔtɔ Ala naxan fi e ma e kɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na taruxui birin sɛbɛxi yi kitaabui kui, kelife ɲama Yurudɛn igiri tɛmui naxɛ, han e naxa nɔ Kanaan bɔxi birin na. Na kui won Ala sɛnbɛ toma nɛ a fanyi ra. A xa ɲama rafan a ma. A laayidi yo tongo e bɛ, a na rakamalima nɛ sɛnbɛ nun xanunteya ra. Na birin findima misaali fanyi nan na won bɛ. Xa won fan findi Ala xa mixie ra, a won malima won ma duniɲɛigiri kui a sɛnbɛ ra, alɔ a a laayidi won bɛ ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa won mali alako won xa na masenyi fahaamu, won man xa la a ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa Masenyi Annabi Yosuwe bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila yarerati Yosuwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Annabi Munsa, Alatala xa konyi to laaxira, Alatala naxa a masen Nunu xa di xɛmɛ Yosuwe bɛ, Annabi Munsa malima, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />«N ma konyi Munsa bara laaxira. Yakɔsi, keli i xa Yurudɛn igiri nun yi ɲama birin na. Wo xa siga bɔxi ma n dɛnnaxɛ sofe Isirayilakae yi ra. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Wo na wo sanyi ti dɛnnaxɛ birin ma, n naa fima nɛ wo ma, alɔ n a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Wo xa naaninyie kelima gbengberen yire nɛ, a sa dɔxɔ Liban geyae ra, han Efirati xure belebele ra, Xitikae xa bɔxi birin sa dɔxɔ Baa Xungbe ra sogegorode. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Mixi yo mu nɔma i ra i xa simaya kui. Won birin na a ra, alɔ muxu nun Munsa nu a ra ki naxɛ. N mu i rabɛɲinma, n mu i raboloma.»<verse eid="JOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />«I i sɛnbɛ so, i xa limaniya, barima i tan nan findima saabui ra yi ɲama bɛ, e xa nɔ kɛ tongode, n nan n kali bɔxi naxan xa fe ra e babae bɛ fife ra e ma. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />I lan nɛ i xa i sɛnbɛ so, limaniya xa lu i bɛ ki fanyi ra. I xa i ɲɛngi sa yi sɛriyɛ birin xɔn ma, i xa a rabatu alɔ n ma konyi Annabi Munsa i yamarixi a ra ki naxɛ. I naxa binya yirefanyi ma, i naxa binya kɔɔla ma, alako i xa xutu sɔtɔ yire ma i na siga dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Yi sɛriyɛ kitaabui falɛ mu lan a xa makuya i dɛ ra. I xa i ɲɛngi sa a xɔn ma kɔɛ nun yanyi, alako i xa a birin nabatu. Naxan birin sɛbɛxi i xa a rawali, barima na nan a niyama i na so fe naxan birin ya ma, i xutu sɔtɔma a ma, i findima a ra na ki nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />N naxan falaxi i bɛ, i naxa nɛɛmu. I i sɛnbɛ so, i xa limaniya. I naxa gaaxu, i naxa hanmɛ, barima i na siga dɛdɛ, i nun n tan i Marigi Alatala birin na a ra.»<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Yosuwe naxa yi yaamari so ɲama xunyie yi ra: <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />«Wo wo ɲɛrɛ ɲama tagi, wo e yaamari yi ra, ‹Wo wo xa donsee xunlan, barima won fama Yurudɛn igiride beenun xi saxan, alako wo xa bɔxi masɔtɔ won Marigi Alatala naxan sofe wo yi.›»<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Yosuwe naxa a fala Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti bɛ, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />«Wo ratu Alatala xa konyi Munsa xa yaamari ma. A to a fala, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala bara malabui fi wo ma. A bara yi bɔxi so wo yi.› <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Wo xa ginɛe, wo xa die, nun wo xa xurusee nɔma lude bɔxi ma Annabi Munsa naxan soxi wo yi ra Yurudɛn kiri ma. Kɔnɔ wo tan tima a gereso ki nan ma wo ngaxakerenyie ya ra. Wo xa e mali, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />han beenun Alatala malabui fima e ma tɛmui naxɛ alɔ wo tan, han e fan xa bɔxi masɔtɔ wo Marigi Alatala naxan fife e ma. Na xanbi, wo man fa gbilen wo xa bɔxi ma, Alatala xa konyi Munsa naxan fixi wo ma Yurudɛn kiri ma, sogetede biri.»<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />E naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «I muxu yamarixi fe naxan birin na, muxu a rabama nɛ. I na muxu xɛɛ dɛnnaxɛ fan, muxu sigama nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Muxu i xui rabatuma nɛ fe birin ma, alɔ muxu Annabi Munsa xui rabatu ki naxɛ. I Marigi Alatala xa bira i fɔxɔ ra alɔ e nun Munsa nu a ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Mixi yo kalabante i xui ma, a mu bira i wɔyɛn xui fɔxɔ ra, i fe naxan birin falama a bɛ, a mu na mɛ, na kanyi faxama nɛ. I xa i sɛnbɛ so, i man xa limaniya.»<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Fe rabɛnfe Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Nunu xa di Yosuwe, naxa fe rabɛnyi firin xɛɛ a gundo ki ma keli Sitimi sigafe ra Yeriko. A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo siga Yeriko taa nun a rabilinyi rabɛnde.» E naxa siga, e sa so Raxabi langoe ginɛ nde xa banxi kui. Na naxa e yigiya naa. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Yerikoka ndee naxa sa a fala e xa mangɛ bɛ, «I bara a to, Isirayilaka mixi firin bara fa to kɔɛ ra, e xa fa yi bɔxi rabɛn.» <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Na kui, Yeriko mangɛ naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Raxabi ma, e xa a fala a bɛ, «Xɛmɛ naxee soxi i xɔnyi, e ramini, barima e faxi yi bɔxi ife nan birin nabɛnde.»<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Kɔnɔ Raxabi nu bara yi xɛmɛ firinyie xanin, a sa e nɔxun. A naxa a fala mangɛ xa xɛɛrae bɛ, «Iyo, yi xɛmɛe fa nɛ n xɔnyi, kɔnɔ n mu e kelide kolon. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />E siga nɛ nunmare ra, taa naadɛ balan tɛmui. Yi xɛmɛe sigaxi dɛdɛ, n mu a kolon. Xa wo sa wo xulun, wo nɔma e suxude!» <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Raxabi nu bara yi xɛmɛe rate banxi gbanyi ra, a e nɔxun sansi xabaxi xaree ya ma. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />E fenmae naxa siga Yurudɛn kira xɔn, han e xure igiride li. E to mini, taakae naxa taa naadɛ balan.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Beenun fe rabɛnyie xa xi, Raxabi naxa te banxi gbanyi ra e yire. <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «N bara a kolon, Alatala bara muxu xa bɔxi so wo yi ra. Wo mirinyi bara a niya limaniya bara ba muxu tan birin yi ra. Yi bɔxi mixie bara sɛrɛn wo ya ra, <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />barima muxu bara a mɛ a Alatala bara Xulunyumi Baa xara wo ya ra, wo nu minima Misira tɛmui naxɛ. Muxu man bara a mɛ wo naxan nabaxi Amorikae xa mangɛ firinyie ra, Sixɔn nun Ogo, naxee nu na Yurudɛn kiri ma. Wo naxa e ratɔn, a nun e kɛ birin na. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Muxu to na fe mɛ, muxu bɔɲɛ naxa kana. Limaniya naxa ba kankan yi ra wo xa fe ra, barima wo Marigi Alatala nan na Ala ra koore nun bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="JOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />«Yakɔsi, wo xa wo kali n bɛ Alatala xili ra, a n kui ifanyiɲa naxan nabaxi wo bɛ, wo fan nɔma na kui ifanyiɲa mɔɔli rabade n tan fan nun n ma denbaya bɛ. Wo xa tɔnxuma nde so n yi ra, alako n xa a kolon <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />wo mu n baba, n nga, n xunyae, n taarae, nun e xa mixi keren faxama.»<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Na xɛmɛe naxa Raxabi yaabi, «Muxu rɛdixi faxafe ma wo ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Xa i mu muxu xa fe fala mixi yo bɛ, muxu fan kui ifanyiɲa rabama nɛ i bɛ dugutɛgɛɲa nun tinxinyi ra, Alatala na yi bɔxi so muxu yi ra tɛmui naxɛ.» <verse eid="JOS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Raxabi naxa na xɛmɛe ragoro luuti ma wundɛri ra, barima a xa banxi nu fatuxi tɛtɛ nan na. A nu sabatixi na tɛtɛ nan kui. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Raxabi naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo siga geya biri, xa na mu a ra wo fenmae wo toma nɛ. Wo xa wo nɔxun mɛnni han xi saxan, beemanu wo fenmae gbilenma tɛmui naxɛ. Na xanbi, wo fa siga wo xa ɲɛrɛ ra.»<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Na xɛmɛe naxa a fala Raxabi bɛ, «Muxu mu muxu xa marakali kanama, <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />kɔnɔ fo i xa yi luuti gbeeli xiri wundɛri ra, i muxu ramini dɛnnaxɛ ra. Muxu na fa tɛmui naxɛ yi bɔxi ma, a lanma muxu xa na luuti li naa. I man xa i baba, i nga, i taarae, i xunyae, nun i xa mixie birin malan be i xa banxi kui. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Xa mixi yo mini i xa banxi kui, xa na kanyi faxa, a a tarixi nɛ, muxu tan fɔxi mu na ki. Kɔnɔ xa muxu xa mixi nde a bɛlɛxɛ din i xa mixi nde ra i xa banxi kui, muxu muxu tarixi nɛ na tɛmui. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Xa i muxu xa fe fala mixi nde bɛ, muxu bara fulun yi marakali ma.» <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Raxabi naxa e yaabi, «Won bara lan na ma.» A naxa na xɛmɛe bɛɲin, e naxa siga. Na tɛmui a naxa na luuti gbeeli xiri wundɛri ra.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Na xɛmɛe naxa siga. E to geya yire li, e naxa e nɔxun naa xi saxan, han e fenmae naxa gbilen. E fenmae naxa e fen kira xɔn, kɔnɔ e mu e to. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Na tɛmui na xɛmɛ firinyie naxa goro geya fari fa, e Yurudɛn igiri, e gbilen Nunu xa di Yosuwe yire. Fe naxan e sɔtɔ, e naxa na birin tagi raba a bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />E naxɛ Yosuwe bɛ, «Muxu a kolon Alatala bara na bɔxi birin sa won bɛlɛxɛ i. Limaniya bara ba na bɔxi mixi birin yi ra tife ra won kanke.»<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Yurudɛn igirife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Yosuwe naxa kurun keli ra Sitimi, e Yurudɛn li, a tan nun Isirayilakae birin. E naxa xi mɛnni han beenun Yurudɛn igiri lɔxɔɛ xa a li. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />A xi saxan nde, ɲama xunyie naxa ɲama yonkinde iɲɛrɛ, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />e fa ɲama yaamari yi ra, «Wo na wo Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira to tɛmui naxɛ, a dɔxɔxi Lewi die sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xun ma, wo xa bira e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Kɔnɔ a lanma yaamilɛ keren xasabi xa lu wo tan nun e tan tagi. Wo naxa wo makɔrɛ e ra de. Wo fama kira tode na ki nɛ wo wo ɲɛrɛma naxan xɔn, barima wo singe mu nu mini na kira ra sinden.» <verse eid="JOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yosuwe naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo wo yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, barima tina Alatala kaabanakoe masenma nɛ wo bɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Na kuye iba, Yosuwe naxa a fala sɛrɛxɛdubɛe bɛ, «Wo saatɛ kankira tongo, wo xa ti ɲama ya ra.» E naxa saatɛ kankira tongo, e naxa e ɲɛrɛ ɲama ya ra.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «N i xa fe gbo fɔlɔma nɛ Isirayilakae birin ya xɔri to lɔxɔɛ, alako e xa a kolon won birin na a ra, alɔ muxu nun Munsa nu a ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />I tan fan xa yi yaamari so sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yi naxee yi saatɛ kankira xaninma, ‹Wo na Yurudɛn xure dɛ li, na tɛmui wo xa goro Yurudɛn ye xɔɔra.›»<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Yosuwe naxa a masen Isirayilakae bɛ, «Wo fa be, wo xa wo tuli mati wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi ra.» <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Yosuwe naxa a masen, «Yi nan fama a niyade wo xa a kolon Ala ɲiɲɛ na a ra. A na wo tagi, a tan fama nɛ Kanaankae, Xitikae, Hiwikae, Perisikae, Girigasakae, Amorikae, nun Yebusukae ragide wo ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Wo bara a to Marigi, naxan na duniɲa birin Marigi ra, na xa saatɛ kankira tixi wo ya ra, a na Yurudɛn igirife. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Yakɔsi wo xa xɛmɛ fu nun firin sugandi Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firinyie ya ma, bɔnsɔɛ keren, xɛmɛ keren. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee duniɲa birin Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xaninma, nee nɛfɛ e sanyi rasin Yurudɛn xure ma, Yurudɛn ye bolonma nɛ. Ye naxan kelima fuge biri ra, na birin a malanma yire keren nɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Ɲama to mini e xa kiri banxie kui Yurudɛn igirife ra, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee saatɛ kankira xaninma, nee fan naxa e ɲɛrɛ fɔlɔ ɲama ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe fɛfɛ Yurudɛn li, e e sanyie rasin ye xɔɔra, Yurudɛn xure naxan ye nu banbaranma yire birin na xɛ xaba tɛmui, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />na ye naxan kelima fuge biri ra, na naxa bolon, a fa malan yire makuye Adama taa longori, naxan nu na Saratan taa fɛ ma. Ye naxan goroma Fɔxɔɛ Baa ma Yurudɛn fole kui, na birin naxa bolon, ɲama naxa giri Yeriko ya tagi. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee nu Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xaninma, nee naxa ti Yurudɛn tagi bɔxi xare ma, han Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin naxa gɛ Yurudɛn igiride e xaraxi ra.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Gɛmɛ fu nun firinyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Ɲama birin to gɛ Yurudɛn igiride, Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />«Wo xɛmɛ fu nun firin mayegeti ɲama ya ma, bɔnsɔɛ keren, xɛmɛ keren. <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />Wo xa e yaamari e xa gɛmɛ fu nun firin tongo Yurudɛn xure tagi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe sanyi xaraxie nu tixi dɛnnaxɛ. Wo e xanin yire wo kɔɛ radangima dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Yosuwe naxa xɛmɛ fu nun firinyie xili e naxee mayegetixi Isirayilakae ya ma, bɔnsɔɛ keren, xɛmɛ keren. <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />Yosuwe naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo dangi wo Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra, wo xa siga Yurudɛn xure tagi. Wo tan mixi keren kerenma birin xa gɛmɛ keren keren tongo Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ kɔnti ma, wo a dɔxɔ wo tunkie fari, <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />alako na xa findi tɔnxuma ra wo tagi. Wo xa die fama wo maxɔrinde tina, ‹Yi gɛmɛe findixi wo bɛ munse ra?› <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Wo a falama nɛ e bɛ, ‹Yi nan a masenxi a Yurudɛn ye bolon nɛ Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra. A nu Yurudɛn igirima tɛmui naxɛ, xure ye birin naxa bolon. Yi gɛmɛe findixi ɲɔxɔ rasiga se nan na Isirayilakae bɛ tɛmui birin.›»<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Yosuwe naxan fala Isirayilakae bɛ, e naxa na raba. E naxa gɛmɛ fu nun firinyie tongo Yurudɛn xure tagi, alɔ Alatala a masen Yosuwe bɛ ki naxɛ, e sa e tongo Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ kɔnti ma. E naxa e xanin ɲama yonkinde, e e dɔxɔ naa. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Yosuwe naxa gɛmɛ fu nun firin gbɛtɛe malan Yurudɛn xure tagi, Ala xa saatɛ kankira xaninmae nu tixi dɛnnaxɛ. Han to na gɛmɛ malanxie na naa. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee nu saatɛ kankira xaninma, nee naxa ti Yurudɛn xure tagi, han ɲama gɛ Alatala xa yaamari birin nabatude, alɔ Annabi Munsa nu bara a masen Yosuwe bɛ ki naxɛ. Ɲama birin naxa dangi mafuren mafuren. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />E to bara gɛ dangide, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa dangi ɲama ya ra, e nun Alatala xa saatɛ kankira. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti naxa dangi, e ti e gereso ki ma Isirayila ɲama ya ra, alɔ Annabi Munsa a fala e bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Geresoe mixi wulu tongo naani ɲɔndɔn naxa dangi Alatala ya tode ra, geresose na e yi ra, e rɛdixi sigafe ra Yeriko fiili ma gere sode.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Na lɔxɔɛ Alatala naxa Yosuwe xili gbo Isirayilakae birin ya xɔri. E naxa a binya a xa simaya kui alɔ e nu Annabi Munsa binyama ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Na xanbi Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />«Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yaamari, naxee sɛriyɛ kankira xaninma, e xa te Yurudɛn xure kui.» <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Yosuwe naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yaamari, «Wo te Yurudɛn xure kui.» <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xaninma, nee nu e sanyi talama tɛmui naxɛ kelife ra Yurudɛn xure kui, Yurudɛn ye man naxa gbilen a yire, a man naxa a ɲɛrɛ fɔlɔ alɔ a singe. A naxa banbaran yɛ Yurudɛn yire birin ma.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Ɲama keli Yurudɛn xure kike singe xi fu nde nɛ, e fa sa yonkin Giligali, Yeriko sogetede biri.<verse eid="JOS 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Yosuwe naxa gɛmɛ fu nun firinyie malan Giligali, e naxee tongo Yurudɛn xure tagi, <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />A naxa a fala Isirayilakae bɛ, «Xa wo xa die sa wo maxɔrin yi gɛmɛe xa fe ra, <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />wo xa e yaabi, ‹Isirayila yi Yurudɛn xure igiri a xaraxi nan na.› <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi xure xaraxi wo ya xɔri nɛ, han wo birin naxa gɛ dangide alɔ wo Marigi Alatala a raba Xulunyumi Baa ra ki naxɛ. Na naxa xara muxu ya xɔri han muxu birin naxa gɛ a igiride, <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />alako duniɲa si birin xa nɔ a kolonde Alatala xɔnyɛ findixi xɔnyɛ barakaxi nan na, wo man xa gaaxu wo Marigi Alatala ya ra.»<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="s">Sunna ti nun Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Amorikae xa mangɛe naxee nu na Yurudɛn kiri ma sogegorode, a nun Kanaan mangɛe naxee birin nu na baa dɛ ra, e to a mɛ, Alatala bara Yurudɛn xara Isirayilakae ya ra, han e birin naxa gɛ giride, e bɔɲɛe naxa bolon, limaniya fan naxa ba e yi ra Isirayilakae xa fe ra. <verse eid="JOS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Na tɛmui, Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «Gɛmɛ xɛyɛnxie yailan finɛe ra, i man xa Isirayilakae sunna.» <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Yosuwe naxa gɛmɛe yailan finɛe ra, a naxa Isirayilakae sunna geya fɛ ma. E naxa naa xili sa laaga.<verse eid="JOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Yosuwe e sunna yi fe nan ma. Ɲama naxan birin keli Misira, xɛmɛ geresoe birin faxa nɛ gbengberenyi kira xɔn ma, e keli xanbi Misira. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Ɲama naxan birin keli Misira, e birin nu sunnaxi, kɔnɔ mixi naxee birin bari gbengberenyi kira xɔn ma e keli xanbi Misira, nee keren mu nu sunnaxi. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Na kui, Isirayilakae nu bara ɲɛ tongo naani ɲɛrɛ raba gbengberenyi ma, han xɛmɛ geresoe birin naxa gɛ faxade naxee tondi Alatala xa yaamari rabatude. Alatala nu bara a kali, a e mu fama bɔxi tode Alatala a kali e babae bɛ naxan xa fe ra a sofe ra e yi, xiɲɛ nun kumi xɛlɛma bɔxi naxan ma. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Alatala e xa die nan findixi e ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Yosuwe naxa e sunna, barima e mu nu sunnaxi biyaasi kui.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />E to gɛ bɔnsɔɛ birin sunnade, e naxa lu yire keren malabude han e birin gɛ yalande. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «To lɔxɔɛ n bara Misira yaagi makuya wo ra.» Na nan a toxi mɛnni xili falama Giligali han to.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Isirayilakae naxa yonkin Giligali Yurudɛn fili ma Yeriko biri ra, e Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba naa nunmare tɛmui, kike xi fu nun naani nde. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali kuye iba, e naxa na bɔxi daxamui, taami lɛbinitare, nun sansi xɔri ganxie don. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />E to bɔxi daxamui don, na kuye iba, mana mu goro sɔnɔn. Isirayilakae fa Kanaan bɔxi daxamui gbansan nan don na ɲɛ ra.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeriko suxui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Lɔxɔɛ nde Yosuwe nu na Yeriko longori. A naxa xɛmɛ nde to, a tixi a ya i, a xa santidɛgɛma mageli suxuxi a yi. Yosuwe naxa a makɔrɛ a ra, a a maxɔrin, «I na muxu tan nan bɛ, ka muxu yaxui nan lanxi i ma?» <verse eid="JOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />A naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «N tan nan na Alatala xa sɔɔrie xa mangɛ ra. N bara fa.» Yosuwe naxa a felen a bun ma, a fa a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi munse masenxi a xa konyi bɛ?» <verse eid="JOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Alatala xa sɔɔri mangɛ naxa a fala Yosuwe bɛ, «I xa sankirie ba i sanyi, barima i tixi yire naxɛ yi ki, yire sɛniyɛnxi na a ra.» Yosuwe naxa a xa sankirie ba a sanyi.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Yosuwe xa xutu sɔtɔɛ Yeriko ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Yeriko sode dɛ birin nu mabalanxi nɛ Isirayilakae xa fe ra. Mixi mu minima, mixi mu soma. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «A mato, n bara Yeriko taa sa i bɛlɛxɛ, a mangɛ, nun a sɔɔri ɲalamae. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />I xa geresoe birin xa yi taa rabilin sanmaya keren xi keren kui, xi senni bun ma. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ mixi solofere xa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi feri solofere suxu e yi ra, e xa ɲɛrɛ saatɛ kankira ya ra. A xi solofere nde, wo xa taa rabilin sanmaya solofere, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nu fa feri fe. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />E na yɛxɛɛ kontonyi feri fe, wo naxa a xui mɛ, ɲama birin xa sɔnxɔɛ gbegbe rate. Na tɛmui tɛtɛ naxan taa rabilinxi, na birama nɛ a yɛtɛ ma. Kankan tixi dɛnnaxɛ biri, a xa so mɛnni ra.»<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Nunu xa di Yosuwe naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xili, a a fala e bɛ, «Wo Alatala xa saatɛ kankira tongo. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ solofere xa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi feri solofere tongo, wo xa ti Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra.» <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />A naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo dangi, wo xa taa rabilin. Makantati singee xa ti Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra.»<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Yosuwe a fala ɲama bɛ ki naxɛ, e naxa a raba na ki. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ solofere, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi feri solofere nu suxuxi naxee yi Alatala ya i, nee naxa e ɲɛrɛ, e nu fa feri fe. Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xaninmae naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Makantati singee naxa ti sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ya ra naxee nu feri fefe. Makantati dɔnxɔɛe naxa ti saatɛ kankira xanbi ra. E nu fa e ɲɛrɛ feri xui ma. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Yosuwe nu bara yi yaamari so ɲama yi ra, «Wo naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate, wo naxa wo xui ite, mixi yo naxa wɔyɛn han n na a falama wo bɛ lɔxɔɛ naxɛ. Na tɛmui kɔrɛ, wo fa sɔnxɔɛ rate.» <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Alatala xa saatɛ kankira naxa taa rabilin sanmaya keren. Na xanbi e naxa gbilen ɲama yonkinde, e xi naa.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Yosuwe naxa keli subaxɛ ma, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa Alatala xa saatɛ kankira tongo. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ soloferee, feri soloferee suxuxi naxee yi, nee naxa e ɲɛrɛ fɔlɔ Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra, e nu fa feri fe. Makantati singee tixi yare, Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra. Makantati dɔnxɔɛe fan tixi a xanbi ra, e e ɲɛrɛma feri xui ma. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />A xi firin nde, e naxa taa rabilin sanmaya keren, e fa gbilen ɲama yonkinde. E naxa na mɔɔli raba xi senni bun ma.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />A xi solofere nde, e naxa keli subaxɛ ma, e taa rabilin alɔ e darixi a ra ki naxɛ. Kɔnɔ yi biyaasi, e naxa na raba sanmaya solofere. E taa rabilin sanmaya solofere na xi solofere nde kansan nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />A sanmaya solofere nde, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa feri fe fa. Yosuwe fa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo sɔnxɔɛ rate, barima Alatala bara yi taa sa wo bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Alatala bara yi taa ratɔn nun a isee birin natɔn, fo Raxabi langoe ginɛ kerenyi peti naxan natangaxi, nun mixi naxee birin na a xa banxi kui, barima a tan nan yigiya fi won ma xɛɛrae ma. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Kɔnɔ wo a idɔyin se ratɔnxie ma, wo naxa keren xanin wo xun, xa na mu a ra Isirayila ɲama findima nɛ se ratɔnxi ra. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Gbeti, xɛɛma, wure, nun wure gbeeli, nee findima Alatala nan gbe ra. Wo xa e ragata a bɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Ɲama naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nu fa feri fe. Ɲama to feri xui mɛ, e naxa sɔnxɔɛ gbegbe rate. Tɛtɛ naxa bira a yɛtɛ ma, ɲama fa so keren na taa kui. Taa naxa findi e gbe ra. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />E naxa taa ratɔn, e na taa mixi birin faxa santidɛgɛma ra, xɛmɛe nun ginɛe, dimɛe nun forie, ningee, yɛxɛɛe nun sofalee. <verse eid="JOS 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yosuwe nu bara a fala yi xɛmɛ firinyi bɛ, naxee siga yi bɔxi rabɛnde, «Wo siga na langoe ginɛ xa banxi kui, wo a ramini a nun a xa mixie birin, alɔ wo wo kali a bɛ ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Yi sɛgɛtala fe rabɛnyi firinyie naxa siga, e sa Raxabi ramini banxi kui. E naxa a baba, a nga, a taarae, a xunyae, nun a baribooree birin namini, e fa e makanta e kerenyi ma Isirayila ɲama yonkinde sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Isirayilakae naxa taa gan a nun a isee birin na, fo gbeti, xɛɛma, wure, nun wure gbeeli. E naxa nee raso naafuli ragatade Alatala xa banxi kui.<verse eid="JOS 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Yosuwe naxa Raxabi langoe ginɛ lu a si ra, a nun a xa mixie birin. Raxabi naxa sabati Isirayilakae ya ma. Han to a bɔnsɔɛe na naa, barima a yigiya fi nɛ Yosuwe xa xɛɛra fe rabɛnyi firinyie ma Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Na waxati Yosuwe naxa yi marakali ti, «Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan gbilenma Yeriko taa ti ra. Na kanyi xa di singe nan findima na biriki singe sare ra, nun a xa di dɔnxɔɛ nan findima taa naadɛ sare ra.»<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Alatala nun Yosuwe nan nu a ra. Yosuwe xili naxa te, a din bɔxi birin na.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Akan xa gbaloe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Kɔnɔ Isirayilakae naxa Alatala xui matandi, e se ndee tongo a tɔnyi dɔxɔxi naxee ra. Akan, Karimi xa mamadi, Sabidi tolobitɛ, Sera xa tolontolonyi, Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, nu bara se ratɔnxie tongo, Alatala bɔɲɛ fa te Isirayilakae xili ma na xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Yosuwe naxa mixie xɛɛ keli Yeriko, sigafe ra Ayi, dɛnnaxɛ na Beti Aweni fɛ ma, Beteli sogetede. A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo te, wo xa sa na bɔxi rabɛn.» Na xɛmɛe naxa te Ayi bɔxi rabɛnde. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />E naxa gbilen Yosuwe yire, e a fala a bɛ, «Hali ɲama birin mu siga, mixi wulu firin, xa na mu mixi wulu saxan nan xa te, e Ayi mixie bɔnbɔma nɛ. I naxa ɲama birin natagan yi fe ma, barima won gerefae mu gbo.» <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Na kui mixi wulu saxan ɲɔndɔn naxa te gere xili ma. Kɔnɔ Ayi mixie naxa nɔ e ra, e fa e gi e ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Ayikae naxa mixi tongo saxan nun senni faxa Isirayilakae ra. E naxa e keri keli taa sode dɛ ra han Sabarimi. E goro goro ma na kira ra, e naxa nɔ e ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:5">Na kui Isirayila ɲama bɔɲɛ naxa kana, limaniya naxa ba e yi ra. <verse eid="JOS 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Yosuwe naxa a xa sose ibɔɔ a ma, a naxa a yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ya i han nunmare, a tan nun Isirayila forie. E naxa bɛndɛ maso e xunyie ma nimisɛ xa fe ra. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Yosuwe naxa a fala, «N Marigi Alatala, munfe ra i a niyaxi yi ɲama xa Yurudɛn igiri? I wama muxu safe Amorikae bɛlɛxɛ nɛ, i xa gan muxu ra? Muxu na a kolon nu, hali muxu lu Yurudɛn naakiri ma nu. <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />N Marigi, n munse falama kɔrɛ, Isirayilakae to e gixi e yaxuie ya ra? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Kanaankae nun yi bɔxi mixie na yi fe mɛ, e muxu digilinma nɛ, e muxu xili ɲɔn yi bɔxi ma. Na kui, i tan fa munse rabama i xili xungbe xa fe ra?»<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «Keli, i i yatagi rafelenxi bɔxi ma munfe ra yi ki? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Isirayila bara yunubi raba. Na kui e bara saatɛ kana n naxan tongo e bɛ. Iyo, e bara se ratɔnxie tongo a mu lan e xa naxan tongo. E bara a muɲa, e a nɔxun e xa kote kui. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Isirayilakae mu nɔma tide e yaxuie ya ra. E e gima nɛ e yaxuie ma, barima e fan yɛtɛ yati bara findi mixi ratɔnxie ra. N mu luma wo fɔxɔ ra, xa wo mu yi se ratɔnxie kana wo naxee tongoxi. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Keli, i xa ɲama rasɛniyɛn. I xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Beemanu tina, wo xa wo yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn. Isirayila Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: «Se ratɔnxie na wo tagi. Isirayila mu nɔma tide e yaxuie ya ra, danmi na se ratɔnxie na wo yi ra.» <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Tina gɛɛsɛgɛ wo wo maso wo bɔnsɔɛ ki ma. Alatala na bɔnsɔɛ naxan masen, na xa a maso a xabilɛ ki ma. Alatala na xabilɛ naxan masen, na xa a maso a denbaya ki ma. Alatala na mixi naxan masen denbaya ya ma, na xa a maso. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Na mixi nun na se ratɔnxie ganma nɛ tɛ ra, barima a bara Alatala xa saatɛ kana, a bara fe raba Isirayila, a mu lan a xa naxan naba.›»<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Yosuwe naxa keli subaxɛ ma, a naxa Isirayila ti a bɔnsɔɛ ki ma. A fe naxa ti Yuda bɔnsɔɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />A naxa Yuda xabilɛe maso, a fe naxa ti Sera xabilɛ. A naxa Sera xabilɛ maso, a denbaya ki ma, a fe naxa ti Sabadi. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />A naxa denbaya xunyie maso, a fe naxa ti Akan, Karimi xa di xɛmɛ, Sabadi xa di xɛmɛ, Sera xa di naxan fatan Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ra.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Yosuwe naxa a fala Akan bɛ, «N ma di, tantui rasiga Alatala ma, Isirayila Marigi Ala. A tantu. I naxan nabaxi, na tagi raba n bɛ a ki ma. I naxa a nɔxun n ma.» <verse eid="JOS 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akan naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «Nɔndi na a ra. N tan nan yunubi rabaxi Alatala ra, Isirayila Marigi Ala. N naxan nabaxi a tan nan yi ki. <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />N Sinari donma nde to nɛ na see ya ma, naxan xa tofanyi maniyɛ mu na, a nun gbeti kole kɛmɛ firin, nun xɛɛma, naxan kilo tagi lima. N naxa mila e ma, n fa e tongo. N bara e biri yili kui n ma kiri banxi bun ma. Gbeti saxi xɛɛma nun donma bun ma.»<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Yosuwe naxa mixie xɛɛ e gi ra, e xa Akan xa kiri banxi mato. Na see nu nɔxunxi yili kui, gbeti saxi e bun ma. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />E naxa a birin nate yili kui kiri banxi bun ma, e a xanin Yosuwe xɔn ma, Isirayila ɲama tagi. E naxa a ibagan bɔxi Alatala ya i. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Yosuwe naxa Sera xa di Akan suxu. A naxa a xa see birin tongo, na gbeti, na donma tofanyi, na xɛɛma, nun a xa kiri banxi. A man naxa a xa di xɛmɛe, a xa di ginɛe, a xa ningee, a xa sofalee, nun a xa xurusee, a naxa na birin suxu, a a xanin Akori gulunba kui. Isirayila birin naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="JOS 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yosuwe naxa a fala Akan bɛ, «I bara muxu xun maɲaaxu, Alatala i fan xun maɲaaxuma nɛ to lɔxɔɛ.» Na masenyi xanbi, Isirayilakae birin naxa e magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra, e e gan. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />E naxa gɛmɛ gbegbe koto a fari. Han to na kotoxi naa. Na kui Alatala bɔɲɛ naxa goro. Na nan a toxi han to, Akori gulunba xili falama na yire xun ma.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Ayi masɔtɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «Hali i mu gaaxu, i bɔɲɛ naxa mini a i. Geresoe birin tongo, wo keli, wo xa siga Ayi gerede. A kolon, n bara Ayi mangɛ sa i bɛlɛxɛ a nun a xa ɲama birin na, a xa taa nun a xa bɔxi. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />I Ayi bɔxi nun a mangɛ xa fe rabama nɛ alɔ i Yeriko bɔxi nun a mangɛ xa fe raba ki naxɛ, kɔnɔ yi biyaasi e xa se fanyie nun e xa xurusee findima wo harige nan na. I fama taa mɛlɛnde a xanbi xanbi nan ma.»<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Yosuwe nun geresoe birin naxa keli, e naxa te Ayi. Yosuwe naxa sɔɔri geresoe fanyi mixi wulu tongo saxan mayegeti, e birin naxa te kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />A naxa yi yaamari so e yi ra, «Wo a idɔyin, wo xa taa mɛlɛn a xanbi xanbi ma. Wo naxa wo makuya taa ra a gbe ra. Wo birin xa wo rɛdi. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />N tan nun n ma ɲama birin, muxu muxu makɔrɛma nɛ taa ra mɛnnikae ya ra. E na mini muxu ralande alɔ a singe ra, muxu fama nɛ muxu gide e ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Na kui e birama nɛ muxu fɔxɔ ra a falafe ra, ‹E na e gife alɔ boore biyaasi.› Na ki muxu fama nɛ e raminide taa fari ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Na tɛmui, wo tan xa mini wo nɔxunde, wo fa taa masɔtɔ. Wo Marigi Alatala naa sama nɛ wo bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Wo na taa suxu, wo tɛ so naa ra, wo naa gan. A tan nan na ki, wo xa Alatala waxɔnfe rakamali, wo xa n ma yaamari rabatu a rabatu ki ma.»<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Yosuwe naxa e rasiga fa, e sa taa mɛlɛn a xanbi xanbi ma. E naxa lu Ayi nun Beteli tagi, Ayi sogegorode. Yosuwe nun ɲama birin naxa xi yonkinde kui na kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Na kuye iba, Yosuwe naxa keli, a ɲama xunmato a ra. A tan nun Isirayila kuntigie naxa te ɲama ya ra, sigafe ra Ayi. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />E tan nun geresoe birin naxa e makɔrɛ Ayi taa ra, e fa yonkinde yailan a kɔɔla biri ra. Gulunba naxa lu e tan nun Ayi tagi. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yosuwe nu bara xɛmɛ wulu suuli ɲɔndɔn xɛɛ taa mɛlɛnde Ayi nun Beteli tagi, Ayi taa sogegorode. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Na kui sɔɔrie xa yonkinde xungbe nu na taa kɔɔla ma, sɔɔri booree nu na taa mɛlɛnfe sogegorode biri. Yosuwe naxa siga na kɔɛ radangi gulunba kui.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Ayi mangɛ to Isirayila sɔɔrie to, a tan nun a xa ɲama naxa mini e gerede fiili yire Araba ya ra. Kɔnɔ a mu nu a kolon xa Isirayilakae bara a xa taa mɛlɛn a xanbi xanbi ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe nun Isirayila ɲama birin naxa e yɛtɛ ragi Ayi mixie ya ra gbengberenyi kira xɔn ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Ayikae naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra keren na. Yosuwe nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa e gi han e gɛ Ayi ɲama birin naminide taa fari ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Xɛmɛ keren mu lu Ayi nun Beteli taae kui, e birin naxa bira Isirayilakae fɔxɔ ra, e xa e suxu. E naxa taa lu na ki, a rabixi.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Na kui, Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «I xa tanbɛ itala Ayi biri ra, naxan suxuxi i yi ra, barima n bara a sa i bɛlɛxɛ.» Yosuwe naxa a xun ti taa ra, a xa tanbɛ suxuxi a yi ra Ayi mabiri. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />A to na raba, sɔɔri mɛlɛntie naxa mini mafuren mafuren e nɔxunde kui, e fa so taa kui, e tɛ so na ra keren na.<verse eid="JOS 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Ayikae to e ya ragbilen e xanbi ra, e naxa a to tuuri na tefe koore ma kelife taa kui. E mu nɔ e gide e xa siga dɛdɛ. Isirayilaka naxee nu na e gife gbengberenyi kira xɔn Ayi mixie ya ra, nee naxa e mafindi e xili ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Yosuwe nun Isirayila ɲama to na tuuri to te ra, e naxa a kolon a sɔɔri mɛlɛntie bara gɛ taa suxude. Na kui e naxa e mafindi, e fa Ayikae bɔnbɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Na mɛlɛntie fan naxa fa kelife taa kui, e xa Ayikae gere. Na kui Ayikae naxa raxɛtɛn, Isirayilakae fa e birin faxa. Mixi yo mu nɔ a gide, mixi yo mu lu a ɲiɲɛ ra, <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />fo Ayi mangɛ, e naxan suxu, e a xanin Yosuwe xɔn.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Isirayilakae to gɛ Ayikae faxade naxee bira e fɔxɔ ra gbengberenyi kira xɔn ma, e naxa gbilen taa fan kui, e Ayika dɔnxɔɛe birin faxa e xa santidɛgɛmae ra. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Ayika naxee birin faxa na lɔxɔɛ, xɛmɛe nun ginɛe, e kɔnti naxa lan mixi wulu fu nun firin ma. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Yosuwe to a xa tanbɛ itala Ayi xun ma, a mu a iso fo naakae birin to gɛ faxade. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Na kui, Isirayila naxa a wasaso Ayi xuruse nun a harige ra, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ Yosuwe bɛ.<verse eid="JOS 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Yosuwe naxa Ayi taa birin kana, a a gan. Han to naa kiroxi. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Naxan findi Ayi mangɛ tan na, e naxa na gbaku wuri ma han nunmare. Nunmare to so, Yosuwe naxa yaamari fi e xa a fure ragoro wuri kɔn na. E naxa a rabira taa sode dɛ ra, e fa gɛmɛ gbegbe malan a fari. Han to na gɛmɛ malanxi naa.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛbade Ebali geya fari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe naxa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ Ebali geya fari, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />alɔ Alatala xa konyi Munsa a fala Isirayilakae bɛ ki naxɛ. E naxa sɛrɛxɛbade gɛmɛ daaxi ti, wure mu nu din naxan na, alɔ a sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa kitaabui kui ki naxɛ. E naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe ba Alatala bɛ na fari.<verse eid="JOS 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Mɛnni Yosuwe naxa Ala xa sɛriyɛ sɛbɛ gɛmɛe ma Isirayilakae birin ya xɔri, Annabi Munsa naxan sɛbɛ e bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Isirayilakae, e xa kuntigie, e xa sɔɔri mangɛe, e xa kiitisae, nun xɔɲɛ naxee nu na e ya ma, e birin naxa siga ti ra Lewi bɔnsɔɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ya i, naxee nu Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xaninma. Ɲama sɛɛti keren naxa ti Garisimi geya biri, ɲama sɛɛti boore naxa ti Ebali geya biri, alɔ Alatala xa konyi Munsa a fala Isirayila ɲama singe bɛ ki naxɛ, a duba e bɛ tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Na xanbi, Yosuwe naxa yi sɛriyɛ masenyi birin ti, dubɛe nun dankɛe, alɔ a sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa kitaabui kui ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Annabi Munsa xa masenyi sɛbɛxi keren mu lu, Yosuwe mu naxan tagi raba Isirayila ɲama birin bɛ, hali ginɛe, dimɛe, nun xɔɲɛ naxee nu na e ya ma.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Gabayonkae xa saatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Yurudɛn naakiri mangɛe, Xitikae, Amorikae, Kanaankae, Perisikae, Hiwikae, nun Yebusukae xa mangɛ, e to yi gere xa fe mɛ, naxan nabaxi Sefela bɔxi geyae fari, Baa Xungbe dɛ ra, Liban geyae sɛɛti ma, <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />e naxa e malan, e lanyi xiri e tagi alako e xa Yosuwe nun Isirayila ɲama gere.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Gabayonkae to a mɛ, Yosuwe naxan nabaxi Yeriko nun Ayi ra, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />e naxa yanfanteya maxiri. E naxa siga a xɔn, bɛki kobie nun wɛni sase ibɔɔxie dɔxɔxi e xa sofalee fari. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />E naxa sankiri fori ɲɔnxi madɛgɛxie so e sanyi, e donma kobi ɲɔnxie ragoro e ma. E naxa taami xuntunyi xaraxie sa e xa kote kui.<verse eid="JOS 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />E to Yosuwe li yonkinde kui Giligali, e naxa a fala a tan nun Isirayilakae bɛ, «Muxu sa kelixi bɔxi makuye nɛ yi ki, alako won xa saatɛ xiri.» <verse eid="JOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Isirayilakae naxa a fala e bɛ, «Won nɔma saatɛ xiride di? Xa a sa li wo kelixi yi bɔxi nan ma, a mu lanma saatɛ xa lu won tagi.» <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />E naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «I xa konyie nan lanxi muxu ma.» Yosuwe naxa e maxɔrin, «Nde na wo tan na? Wo kelixi minden?» <verse eid="JOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />E naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «I xa konyie kelixi bɔxi makuye nan ma i Marigi Alatala xili xa fe ra, barima muxu bara a xa fe ifalɛ mɛ, a naxan nabaxi Misira, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />a nun a fe naxan birin nabaxi Amorikae xa mangɛ firinyie ra Yurudɛn naakiri ma, Xɛsibɔn mangɛ Sixɔn, nun Basan mangɛ Ogo, naxan nu sabatixi Asataroti.»<verse eid="JOS 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />«Muxu xa forie nun bɔxi mixi birin a falaxi nɛ muxu bɛ, ‹Wo wo fandɛ tongo wo naxan donma kira xɔn ma. Wo xa siga Isirayilakae ralan, wo xa a fala e bɛ wo xa konyie nan muxu ra.› Yakɔsi, won xa saatɛ tongo won boore bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Wo bara muxu xa taamie to? Muxu to keli muxu xɔnyi, taami fanyi na nu a ra, kɔnɔ yakɔsi a birin bara xara. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Muxu xa wɛni sase nɛɛnɛe nu rafexi wɛni fanyi ra, kɔnɔ yakɔsi na birin bara ɲɔn, wɛni sasee bara bɔɔ. Wo muxu xa donmae mato, a nun muxu xa sankirie. E birin bara kana yi kira xa makuye bɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Isirayilakae naxa na birin mato, kɔnɔ e mu Alatala maxɔrin xa a findixi nɔndi nan na. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Na kui Yosuwe naxa lanyi xiri e tagi e xa simaya makantafe ra. Marakali naxa lu e tagi.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Xi saxan to dangi na saatɛ xirife ra, Isirayilakae naxa a kolon a e dɔxɔbooree nan lanxi e ma. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Na lɔxɔɛ Isirayilakae naxa siga, e sa so e xa taae kui, naxan findixi Gabayon, Kefira, Beeroti, nun Kiriyati Yeyarimi. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Isirayilakae mu e faxa saatɛ xa fe ma, bɔxi yareratie naxan tongo Gabayonkae bɛ Isirayila Marigi Alatala xili ra, kɔnɔ ɲama birin naxa xurutuxurutu e xa yareratie ma. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Mangɛe naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Muxu tan nan muxu kalixi e bɛ Isirayila Marigi Alatala xili ra. Won mu nɔma won bɛlɛxɛ dinde e ra. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Yakɔsi won e xa fe suxuma yi ki nɛ. Won e luma e si nan na alako won naxa Alatala raxɔnɔ marakali kanafe ra. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Won naxa e faxa, kɔnɔ won xa e rawali wuri sɛgɛfe nun ye bafe ra ɲama birin bɛ.» Na kui Isirayila yareratie xa saatɛ mu kanama.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Yosuwe naxa e xili, a wɔyɛn e bɛ, «Munfe ra wo muxu yanfaxi, wo a fala muxu bɛ, a wo sabatixi yire makuye nɛ, a fa sa a li, wo sabatixi muxu sɛɛti nan ma? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Na kui wo bara dankɛ sɔtɔ, wo bara findi muxu xa konyie ra. Wuri sɛgɛfe nun ye bafe wali luma wo tan nan xun ma muxu Marigi Ala xa ɲama bɛ abadan.»<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />E naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «Muxu bara a mɛ, i Marigi Alatala a fala nɛ a xa konyi Munsa bɛ, a xa yi bɔxi birin so wo yi ra, a xa bekae sɔntɔ wo ya xɔri. Wo xa fa bara gaaxui gbegbe lu muxu ma muxu nii xa fe ra. Na nan a toxi muxu bara wo yanfa. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Yakɔsi, muxu na wo sago. Wo xa muxu xa fe raba alɔ wo wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ tinxinyi kui.» <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Yosuwe naxa na tinxinyi raba, a mu a lu Isirayilakae xa e faxa. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Na lɔxɔɛ a naxa wuri sɛgɛfe nun ye bafe wali dɔxɔ e xun ma Isirayila ɲama birin bɛ, a nun Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade bɛ, naxan na Alatala xa yire sugandixi. Han to Gabayonkae na na wali kui.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Gere belebele Gabayon fɛ ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Darisalamu mangɛ Adoni Sedeki naxa a mɛ a Yosuwe bara Ayi taa suxu, a bara naa ratɔn, a bara Ayi bɔxi nun a mangɛ xa fe raba alɔ a Yeriko bɔxi nun a mangɛ xa fe raba ki naxɛ. A man bara a mɛ a Gabayon nun Isirayila bara lanyi xiri, a nee sabatixi e tagi. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />E naxa gaaxu na xa fe ra, barima mangataa belebele nan nu na Gabayon na, naxan xungbo Ayi bɛ. E xa sɔɔrie nu findixi xɛmɛ gbangbalanyie nan na. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Darisalamu mangɛ Adoni Sedeki naxa xɛɛra xɛɛ, a xa sa a fala Xebiron mangɛ Hohami bɛ, Yaramuti mangɛ Pirami bɛ, Lakisi mangɛ Yafiya bɛ, a nun Egilon mangɛ Debiri bɛ, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />«Wo te n yire, wo xa fa kafu n ma alako won xa Gabayon gere, barima e tan nun Yosuwe nun Isirayilakae bara lanyi xiri.» <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Yi Amori mangɛ suulie: Darisalamu mangɛ, Xebiron mangɛ, Yaramuti mangɛ, Lakisi mangɛ, nun Egilon mangɛ naxa te nun e xa sɔɔrie ra. E naxa e xa yonkinde yailan Gabayon ya ra, e fa gere ti e bɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Gabayonkae naxa xɛɛra xɛɛ Isirayilakae xa yonkinde Giligali, e xa sa a fala Yosuwe bɛ, «I naxa i xa konyie rabɛɲin. I xa te muxu yire mafuren. I xa muxu ratanga Amori mangɛe ma, naxee sabatixi geya yire, e wama muxu gerefe.» <verse eid="JOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Yosuwe nun a xa sɔɔri ɲalamae naxa keli Giligali, e siga Gabayon.<verse eid="JOS 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «I naxa gaaxu e ya ra, barima n bara gɛ e sade i bɛlɛxɛ. Mixi keren mu nɔma tide i ya ra e ya ma.» <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Na kui Yosuwe nun a xa mixie naxa keli Giligali, e ɲɛrɛ kɔɛ ra, alako e xa sin Amorikae xun ma tɛrɛnna ra. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Alatala naxa Amorikae keri Isirayila ya ra, a fa nɔ e ra sɛnbɛ ra Gabayon. Isirayilakae naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra kira xɔn naxan tema Beti Xoron, e naxa e bɔnbɔ han Aseka nun Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />E to nu e gima Isirayilakae ya ra gorofe Beti Xoron kira xɔn, Alatala naxa balabalanyi xɔri belebele ragoro e ma keli koore ma, han e sa Aseka li. Na balabalanyi xa mixi faxaxie dangi mixie ra, Isirayilakae naxee faxa e xa santidɛgɛma ra.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Alatala nu Amorikae safe Isirayila bɛlɛxɛ tɛmui naxɛ, Yosuwe nu bara Alatala maxandi Isirayilakae ya xɔri a xa soge raxara Gabayon xun, a xa kike raxara Ayalon gulunba xun. <verse eid="JOS 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Soge nun kike naxa e raxara, han Isirayila naxa gɛ e waxɔnyi rabade e yaxuie ra. Yi fe sɛbɛxi Yasari xa buki kui. Soge naxa a raxara koore tagi, soge mu gbata dulade fɛɛɲɛn keren kui. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Han to na fe mɔɔli mu toxi duniɲa. Alatala nu bara Yosuwe xa maxandi suxu, a nu na gere sofe Isirayila bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa gbilen e xa yonkinde Giligali.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Na mangɛ suulie e gi nɛ, e sa e nɔxun Makeda fɔnmɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Mixi nde naxa a fala Yosuwe bɛ, «Na mangɛ suulie na e nɔxunfe Makeda fɔnmɛ kui.» <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Yosuwe naxa yaamari fi, «Wo gɛmɛ belebelee mayindigilin na fɔnmɛ dɛ ma, wo sɔɔri ndee ti naa. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Wo tan dɔnxɔɛe, wo naxa dugundi, wo xa bira wo yaxuie fɔxɔ ra, wo fa kira bolon e ya ra, alako e naxa nɔ e xɔnyi masɔtɔde, barima wo Marigi Alatala bara e sa wo bɛlɛxɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Na kui Yosuwe nun a xa sɔɔriee naxa nɔ Amorikae ra, fo mixi keren kerenyi naxee e gi, e sa e xa taa makantaxie masɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Isirayila xa sɔɔrie birin naxa gbilen bɔɲɛsa kui Yosuwe yire Makeda yonkinde kui. Mixi yo mu nɔ e ra.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe naxa a fala, «Wo yi gɛmɛe ba fɔnmɛ dɛ ma, wo xa yi mangɛ suulie ramini.» <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />E naxa na mixi suuli ramini: Darisalamu mangɛ, Xebiron mangɛ, Yaramuti mangɛ, Lakisi mangɛ, nun Egilon mangɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />E to yi mangɛe ramini Yosuwe ma, Yosuwe naxa Isirayila sɔɔrie birin xili, a a fala e xa yareratie bɛ, «Wo wo maso, wo xa wo sanyi ti yi mangɛe kɔnyie ma.» E naxa e maso, e e sanyi ti e kɔnyie ma. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yosuwe naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo naxa gaaxu, wo bɔɲɛ naxa mini a i. Wo wo sɛnbɛ so, wo man xa limaniya, barima Alatala wo yaxuie birin ma fe rabama yi ki nɛ, wo nun naxee nɛ gerema.»<verse eid="JOS 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Na birin to dangi, Yosuwe naxa e faxa, a fa e gbaku wuri suuli kɔn na han nunmare. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Soge dula tɛmui, Yosuwe naxa yaamari fi e xa e ragoro wuri kɔn na, e xa e raso fɔnmɛ kui, e nu nɔxunxi dɛnnaxɛ. E naxa gɛmɛ belebelee dɔxɔ na dɛ ma. Han to naa na na ki.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Na lɔxɔɛ Yosuwe naxa Makeda fan suxu, a mɛnnikae nun e xa mangɛ sɔntɔ santidɛgɛma ra. A mu mixi keren lu. A naxa Makeda mangɛ xa fe raba alɔ a Yeriko mangɛ xa fe raba ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Yosuwe nun Isirayila xa sɔɔrie naxa keli Makeda, e siga Libina gerede. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Alatala naxa naakae nun e xa mangɛ sa e bɛlɛxɛ. E naxa na mixi birin sɔntɔ e xa santidɛgɛma ra, e mu mixi keren lu. E naxa Libina mangɛ xa fe raba alɔ e Yeriko mangɛ xa fe raba ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Yosuwe nun Isirayila xa sɔɔrie naxa keli Libina, e siga Lakisi gerede. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Na kuye iba, Alatala naxa Lakisi sa e bɛlɛxɛ. E naxa na mixi birin faxa santidɛgɛma ra, alɔ e Libina xa fe raba ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Geseri mangɛ Horami naxa te kafude Lakisi ma, kɔnɔ Yosuwe naxa a tan nun a xa sɔɔrie birin faxa, a mu mixi keren lu.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Yosuwe nun Isirayila xa sɔɔrie naxa keli Lakisi, e siga Egilon gerede. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Na lɔxɔɛ e naxa mɛnnikae birin sɔntɔ, alɔ e Lakisi xa fe raba ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Yosuwe nun Isirayila xa sɔɔrie naxa keli Egilon, e siga Xebiron gerede. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />E naxa mɛnnikae birin, e xa mangɛ, nun e dɔxɔbooree sɔntɔ, e mu mixi keren lu. E naxa e xa fe raba alɔ e Egilon xa fe raba ki naxɛ, e mɛnnikae birin faxa.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe nun Isirayila xa sɔɔrie naxa e mafindi Debiri taa xili ma, e xa e gere. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />E naxa mɛnnikae birin, e xa mangɛ, nun e dɔxɔbooree sɔntɔ, e mu mixi keren lu. E naxa e xa fe raba alɔ e Libina, a mangɛ, nun Xebiron xa fe raba ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Yosuwe naxa nɔ na bɔxi birin na, geya yire, Negewi gbengberenyi, Sefela bɔxi, nun a mangɛe. A naxa na mixi birin sɔntɔ alɔ Isirayila Marigi Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yosuwe naxa e gere keli Kadesi Barineya han Gasa, Gosen bɔxi birin, sa dɔxɔ Gabayon na. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Yosuwe naxa nɔ na taae nun e mangɛe ra tɛmui kerenyi ra, barima Isirayila Marigi Alatala nan nu gere soma Isirayila bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe nun Isirayila xa sɔɔrie birin naxa gbilen e xa yonkinde Giligali.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Gere xungbe Meromi xure fɛ ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Xasori mangɛ Yabini to yi fee mɛ, a naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ yi mixie xɔn ma: Madon mangɛ Yobabo, Simiron mangɛ, Akisafa mangɛ, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />mangɛ naxee nu sabatixi geyae fari kɔɔla ma, naxee nu sabatixi Yurudɛn gulunba kui, naxee nu sabatixi Kinereti Baa yirefanyi ma, naxee nu sabatixi Sefela bɔxi ma, naxee nu Dɔrɔ rabilinyi ma sogegorode, <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Kanaankae naxee nu na sogetede nun sogegorode, Amorikae, Xitikae, Perisikae, Yebusukae naxee nu na geyae fari, a nun Hiwikae naxee nu na Xerimon geya bunyi Misipa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Na mangɛe naxa e xa sɔɔrie birin malan, naxee wuya alɔ mɛyɛnyi baa dɛ ra. Soe gbegbe nun sɔɔri ragise gbegbe fan nu na e yi. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Yi mangɛe naxa lan fe keren ma, e naxa sa e xa yonkinde ti Meromi xure fɛ ma Isirayilakae gerefe ma.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, «Hali i mu gaaxu e ya ra, barima tina yi tɛmui ma, n tan e birin sama nɛ i bɛlɛxɛ, i e faxa Isirayilakae ya xɔri. I fama nɛ e xa soe san fasɛe bolonde, i fama nɛ e xa sɔɔri ragisee gande.»<verse eid="JOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Yosuwe nun a xa geresoee naxa sin e ma Meromi xure fɛ ma. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Alatala naxa e sa Isirayila bɛlɛxɛ. E naxa e bɔnbɔ, e e keri han Sidɔn taa xungbe kui, han Misirefoti Mayimi, han Misipa gulunba ra sogetede biri. E naxa e bɔnbɔ, e mu mixi keren lu. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yosuwe naxa e xa fe raba alɔ Alatala a masen a bɛ ki naxɛ. A naxa e xa soe san fasɛe bolon, a e xa sɔɔri ragisee fan gan.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />A gbilen gbilen ma, Yosuwe naxa Xasori bɔxi fan suxu, a naxa a mangɛ faxa santidɛgɛma ra, barima a tan nan nu na mangataa ra na bɔxi birin xun. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Yosuwe xa sɔɔrie naxa e sɔntɔ santidɛgɛma ra, e mu mixi keren lu a si ra. Na dangi xanbi e naxa Xasori taa gan.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Yosuwe naxa na taae birin suxu, a mɛnnikae nun e mangɛe faxa santidɛgɛma ra, a mɛnni ratɔn alɔ Alatala xa konyi Munsa a fala a bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila xa sɔɔrie mu taae gan naxee nu na geyae fari, fo Xasori keren Yosuwe dɛnnaxɛ gan. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Isirayila naxa a wasaso yi taae harige nun e xa xurusee ra, kɔnɔ e naxa mixie tan birin faxa santidɛgɛma ra. E mu mixi keren lu a ɲiɲɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Alatala naxan yamari a xa konyi Munsa bɛ, Annabi Munsa fan naxa na yamari Yosuwe bɛ. Yosuwe naxa na birin naba alɔ Alatala a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Yosuwe naxa na bɔxi birin masɔtɔ: geya yire, Negewi gbengberenyi, Gosen bɔxi, Sefela bɔxi, nun Yurudɛn gulunba, kelife Isirayila geyae ma han baa dɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Keli geya Mageli itexi ra Seyiri biri ra, han Bali Gadi, Liban gulunba kui, Xerimon geya bunyi, a naxa naa mangɛe birin suxu, a e sɔntɔ. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yosuwe nun yi mangɛe naxa gere xɔnkuye raba. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Taa yo mu nu na naxan tin Isirayila xa lanbooreɲa ra, fo Gabayon keren Hiwikae nu sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ. Isirayilakae naxa na dɔnxɔɛe birin gere. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Alatala nan Kanaankae xaxilie raxɔrɔxɔ, alako Isirayila mixie xa e gere, e xa e ratɔn, e naxa kinikini e ma fefe ma, alɔ Alatala a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Na waxati kerenyi kui, Yosuwe naxa Anaki bɔnsɔɛ fan gere, a e sɔntɔ Xebiron, Debiri, Anaba, nun geya yire naxee nu na Yudaya nun Isirayila bɔxi ma. Yosuwe naxa e birin halaki, a e xa taae kana. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Na dangi xanbi Anaki bɔnsɔɛ keren mu lu Isirayila bɔxi ma. Naxee mu faxa, nee naxa sabati Gasa, Gati, nun Asidodi taae kui. <verse eid="JOS 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Na kui, Yosuwe naxa na bɔxi birin masɔtɔ alɔ Alatala a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ. A naxa a itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma e kɛ ra. Na tɛmui, bɔxi naxa xinbeli, gere yo mu so fa.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛe nɔfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Mangɛe nan ya Isirayilakae nɔ naxee ra, e e xa taae tongo Yurudɛn sogetede biri ra, fɔlɔfe Arinon xure ma, a sa dɔxɔ Xerimon geya ra, han a sa Yurudɛn gulunba birin li sogetede biri:<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Amori mangɛ Sixɔn, naxan nu sabatixi Xɛsibɔn, a xa mangɛya nu fɔlɔma Aroweri, naxan tixi Arinon xure dɛ ra, han a sa dɔxɔ Yaboko xure ra, Amoni naaninyi. Yi birin nu findixi Galadi bɔxi sɛɛti keren nan na. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />A man naxa Yurudɛn gulunba sogetede fan yaamari, kelife Kinereti Baa han Fɔxɔɛ Baa Yurudɛn gulunba ra, Beti Yesimoti taa na dɛnnaxɛ. A xa bɔxi nu sigaxi itala ra yirefanyi biri ra han Pisiga geya ra.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Basan mangɛ Ogo, Refa bɔnsɔɛ mixi dɔnxɔɛ nde, naxan nu dɔxɔxi Asataroti nun Edereyi taae. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />A xa mangɛya nu fɔlɔma Xerimon geya nan ma, a siga Salaka, han a sa Basan bɔxi birin li. A xa mangɛya naaninyi nu na Gesurikae nun Maakakae xa bɔxi nan fɛ ma. Yi birin nu findixi Galadi sɛɛti boore nan fan na, han Xɛsibɔn mangɛ Sixɔn xa mangɛya fɔlɔde.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Annabi Munsa, Alatala xa konyi nun Isirayilakae naxa nɔ na mangɛe birin na. Alatala xa konyi Annabi Munsa naxa e xa ɲamanɛ so Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren yi ra, mɛnni xa findi nee gbe ra.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Mangɛyae nan ya Yosuwe nun Isirayilakae naxee masɔtɔ Yurudɛn kiri ma sogegorode, fɔlɔfe Bali Gadi ma Liban gulunba, han Xalaka geya Seyiri biri ra. Yosuwe naxa yi bɔxi birin itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma, kankan xa a gbe kɛ sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />E bɔxi naxee sɔtɔ na birin nalanxi na, Isirayila geyae, Sefela bɔxi, Yurudɛn gulunba, gbengberen yire, nun Negewi gbengberenyi nan na. Xitikae, Amorikae, Kanaankae, Perisikae, Hiwikae, nun Yebusukae nan nu sabatixi mɛnni.<verse eid="JOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Mangɛe nan ya e nɔxi naxee ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 12:9">Yeriko mangɛ, Ayi mangɛ naxan nu na Beteli fɛ ma,<verse eid="JOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Darisalamu mangɛ, Xebiron mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />Yaramuti mangɛ, Lakisi mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />Egilon mangɛ, Geseri mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />Debiri mangɛ, Gederi mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />Horoma mangɛ, Aradi mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />Libina mangɛ, Adulama mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />Makeda mangɛ, Beteli mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />Tapuwa mangɛ, Xeferi mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />Afeki mangɛ, Lasarɔn mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />Madon mangɛ, Xasori mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />Simiron Meron mangɛ, Akisafa mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />Taanaki mangɛ, Megido mangɛ,<verse eid="JOS 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />Kedesi mangɛ, Yokanayimi mangɛ naxan nu na Karemele biri,<verse eid="JOS 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />Dɔrɔ mangɛ, naxan nu na Dɔrɔ bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 12:23">Goyimi mangɛ naxan nu na Giligali bɔxi ma,<verse eid="JOS 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />nun Tirisa mangɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 12:24">Na birin nalanxi, mangɛ tongo saxan a nun keren.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Bɔxi masɔtɔtaree</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Yosuwe to gɛ foride, Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, «I bara fori kɔnɔ ɲamanɛ gbegbe man na wo lan wo xa naxee sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Filisitakae nun Gesurikae xa bɔxi luxi sinden. <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />Bɔxi naxan fɔlɔma Sixori xure ma Misira ya tagi, han a sa Ekiron li, naxan na kɔɔla ma, na birin Kanaankae nan gbe nu a ra, kɔnɔ na waxati Awikae nu naa suxuxi e yi, e nun Filisita mangɛdi suulie, naxee nu na Gasa, Asidodi, Asikalɔn, Gati, nun Ekiron. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Kanaankae xa bɔxi fan luxi, fɔlɔfe Meyara taa ma Sidɔnkae na dɛnnaxɛ, han a sa Afeki li. Amorikae xa bɔxi fan luxi.»<verse eid="JOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />«Gebalakae nun Libankae xa bɔxi fan luxi, fɔlɔfe Bali Gadi ma Xerimon geya bunyi, han a sa Xamata li. <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />Sidɔnka naxee birin na geyae fari, fɔlɔfe Liban geyae ma, han a sa Misirefoti Mayimi li, n fama e keride Isirayilakae ya xɔri. I xa na birin fi Isirayila ma kɛ ra, alɔ n a masenxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />I xa yi bɔxi itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ solomanaani ma, a nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti boore ma.»<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manasi, Ruben, nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nu bara e gbe kɛ sɔtɔ Yurudɛn kiri ma sogetede biri ra, Ala xa konyi Munsa saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />E xa bɔxi sa fɔlɔxi kafi Aroweri, taa naxan na Arinon xure fɛ ma, a geya bunyi taa li, a Medeba fiili li, han a sa Dibon li, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />a sa Amori mangɛ Sixɔn Xɛsibɔnka xa taae birin li han Amonikae xa naaninyi ra. <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />E man naxa Galadi sɔtɔ, Gesurikae nun Maakakae xa bɔxi, Xerimon geya, nun Basan bɔxi han a sa Salaka li. <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />Basan mangɛ Ogo fan xa bɔxi, naxan nu dɔxɔxi Asataroti nun Edereyi taae, naxan findi Refa bɔnsɔɛ mixi dɔnxɔɛ ra, na fan gbe birin naxa findi Isirayilakae gbe ra. Annabi Munsa naxa nɔ yi ɲamanɛ birin na, a naxa e xa bɔxi birin tongo. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Kɔnɔ Isirayilakae mu Gesurikae nun Maakakae keri. Han to e sabatixi Isirayilakae ya ma.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔɛ kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Annabi Munsa mu bɔxi yo fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tan ma, barima sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi naxee bama Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ, e nee nan findixi e tan gbe kɛ ra alɔ Ala a masen ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Annabi Munsa nu bara bɔxi fi Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ma, e xabilɛ ki ma. <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />E xa bɔxi naxa fɔlɔ Aroweri Arinon xure dɛ ra, a taa li naxan na geya bunyi, han a sa Medeba rabilinyi li, <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />a Xɛsibɔn li, nun taa naxee birin na naa rabilinyi. Na taae xili: Dibon, Bamoti Bali, Beti Bali Meyoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Yahasi, Kedemoti, Mefaati, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriyatayimi, Sibima, Sɛrɛti Saxari naxan na geya fari, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Beti Peyori, Pisiga geya fari, Beti Yesimoti, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />taa naxee birin na fiili ma nun Amori mangɛ Sixɔn, naxan nu dɔxɔxi Xɛsibɔn, na xa bɔxi birin. Annabi Munsa nu bara mangɛ Sixɔn faxa, a nun Madiyan mangɛdie Efi, Rekemi, Suru, Xuru, nun Reba. E nu sabatixi bɔxi kui Sixɔn xa mangɛya bun ma. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Isirayilakae naxa Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami fan faxa santidɛgɛma ra, naxan nu duureya rabama. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Yurudɛn xure findixi Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa naaninyi nan na sogegorode biri ra. Na taae nun e xa bɔxie findixi Ruben bɔnsɔɛ gbe nan na.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Annabi Munsa naxa yi bɔxi fi Gadi bɔnsɔɛ ma e xabilɛ ki ma: <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Yaasɛri bɔxi, Galadi bɔxi taae birin, nun Amoni bɔxi sɛɛti keren, han a sa Aroweri li, Raba ya tagi, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />kafi Xɛsibɔn han a sa Ramati Misipa nun Betonimi li, kafi Maxanayimi han a sa Debiri bɔxi li, <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />a sa Beti Harama, Beti Nimira, Sukɔti, nun Sefon li, taa naxee nu na Yurudɛn xure fɛ ma, a sa Xɛsibɔn mangɛ Sixɔn xa bɔxi birin li, nun Yurudɛn rabilinyi sogetede biri han a sa dɔxɔ Kinereti Baa ra. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Yi birin naxa findi Gadi bɔnsɔɛ kɛ ra e xabilɛ ki ma, kankan nun a xa taa, nun a daaxa.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Annabi Munsa naxa yi bɔxi fi Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe ma, Manasi xa die sɛɛti keren ma: <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Basan bɔxi birin, naxan nu Basan mangɛ Ogo xa mangɛya bun ma, fɔlɔfe Maxanayimi, han a sa Yayiri li. Na findi taa tongo senni nan na. <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />E man naxa Galadi bɔxi sɛɛti keren sɔtɔ, e naxa Asataroti nun Edereyi taae sɔtɔ, naxee nu findixi Basan mangɛ Ogo gbe ra. Manasi xa di Makiri naxa yi birin sɔtɔ a xa die sɛɛti keren bɛ e xabilɛ ki ma.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Annabi Munsa naxa yi kɛ fi Isirayilakae ma a nu na Mowaba fiili ma tɛmui naxɛ, Yurudɛn kiri ma Yeriko sogetede biri. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Kɔnɔ Annabi Munsa mu bɔxi yo fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tan ma. Isirayila Marigi Alatala nan nu na a kɛ ra alɔ Ala a masen ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ solomanaani xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Nunu xa di Yosuwe, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari, nun xabilɛ kuntigie Kanaan bɔxi itaxun Isirayilakae ma kɛ ra yi ki nɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Bɔxi naxa itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ solomanaani nun a tagi ma Ala xa mali saabui ra, alɔ Alatala a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Bɔxi naxan na Yurudɛn xure kiri ma sogetede biri, Annabi Munsa naxa na fi bɔnsɔɛ firin nun a tagi ma, kɔnɔ a mu bɔxi yo fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ tan ma. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Annabi Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ nu bara itaxun firin na, Manasi nun Efirami. Annabi Munsa mu bɔxi yo fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma naxan findixi e gbe yati ra, fo taae, e sabatima dɛnnaxɛ nun fiilie e xurusee dɛmadonma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Isirayilakae naxa na bɔxi itaxun e boore tagi alɔ Alatala a masenxi ki naxɛ Annabi Munsa bɛ.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebi Xebiron sɔtɔfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ndee nun Kenisi xa di Kalebi naxa siga Yosuwe xɔn. Kalebi naxa a fala a bɛ, «I a kolon Alatala naxan fala Annabi Munsa bɛ won firin xa fe ra Kadesi Barineya. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />N ɲɛ tongo naani nan nu a ra, Alatala xa konyi Annabi Munsa n xɛɛxi tɛmui naxɛ kelife Kadesi Barineya sigafe ra Kanaan bɔxi ma mɛnni rabɛnde. N to gɛ na ra, n naxa dɛntɛgɛ fanyi sa a bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />N nan ngaxakerenyi naxee n mati naa, nee naxa limaniya ba ɲama yi ra, kɔnɔ n tan bira n Marigi Alatala nan tun fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Na kui Annabi Munsa naxa laayidi tongo n bɛ yi ki, ‹I i ɲɛrɛxi bɔxi naxan ma, na findima nɛ i tan nun i xa die kɛ ra tɛmui birin, barima i bara bira n Marigi Alatala xui fɔxɔ ra a ki ma.›»<verse eid="JOS 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />«Ɲɛ tongo naani nun suuli bara dangi kabi Alatala naxa na masen Annabi Munsa bɛ, won nu na gbengberenyi ma tɛmui naxɛ. Alatala bara n ma simaya rasiga han ɲɛ tongo solomasaxan a nun suuli. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />To, n sɛnbɛ man luxi alɔ Annabi Munsa n xɛɛxi tɛmui naxɛ. N nɔma gere sode yi waxati alɔ n na raba ki naxɛ a singe ra. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Awa, i xa yi geya bɔxi fi n ma alɔ Alatala laayidi tongo n bɛ ki naxɛ na lɔxɔɛ. Na lɔxɔɛ i nu a kolon Anaki bɔnsɔɛ na mɛnni, e xa taa xungbe makantaxi a fanyi ra. Alatala gbansan xa lu n sɛɛti ma. Na kui n nɔma e keride alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Yosuwe naxa duba Yefune xa di Kalebi bɛ, a Xebiron xa fi a ma kɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Na taa na a xa die bɛlɛxɛ han to, barima Yefune Kenisika xa di Kalebi bira Isirayila Marigi Alatala nan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Kabi na tɛmui bɔɲɛsa naxa lu na bɔxi ma, gere yo mu nu na sɔnɔn. Singe Xebiron xili nu falama nɛ Kiriyati Araba, barima Araba nan nu findixi Anaki mixie xa kuntigi ra.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Bɔxi naxan fixi Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ma e xabilɛ ki ma Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra, sa fɔlɔxi Edon naaninyi nan na, a sa dɔxɔ Sini gbengberenyi ra yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Na naaninyi fɔlɔxi Fɔxɔɛ Baa dɛ yirefanyi nan ma naxan na Negewi gbengberenyi ma, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />a siga Tali geya yirefanyi ma Sini biri ra, a te Kadesi Barineya yirefanyi ma han a sa dangi Xesiron na, a man te Adari, a siga han Karaka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Na xanbi a Asimon li, a siga Misira xure han baa dɛ ra. Yudayakae xa naaninyi nan na ki yirefanyi biri ra.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Yudaya naaninyi sogetede biri findixi Fɔxɔɛ Baa dɛ nan na, han Yurudɛn xure sinma baa xun dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:5">A naaninyi kɔɔla biri fɔlɔma Yurudɛn xure sinma baa xun dɛnnaxɛ, <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />a te Beti Xogala biri ra, a siga Beti Araba, han Ruben xa di Bohan xa gɛmɛ yire ra. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Na naaninyi texi han Debiri, a dangi Akori gulunba kui ra, a siga kɔɔla ma han Giligali, naxan na Adumimi geya ya ra, xure yirefanyi ma. Na naaninyi sigaxi han En Semesi dulonyi ra, a mini En Rogeli ra. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />A keli mɛnni, a goro Hinoma xa gulunba kui, Yebusukae xa taa yirefanyi ma. Na taa findixi Darisalamu nan na. A siga han geya fari ma Hinoma xa gulunba ya ra sogetede biri nun Refa bɔnsɔɛ xa gulunba raɲɔnyi ra kɔɔla biri ra. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kelife na geya fari ma, naaninyi sigama han Nefetowa dulonyi ra. Na xanbi a taa ndee li naxee na Eferon geya fari, a siga Baala, dɛnnaxɛ xili Kiriyati Yeyarimi. <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />A Keli mɛnni a siga sogegorode biri han a Seyiri geya li, a siga Yeyarimi geya sɛɛti ma, dɛnnaxɛ xili Kɛsalɔn. A man siga Beti Semesi, han a Timina li. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Na naaninyi sigaxi Ekiron nun Sikirɔn taae sɛɛti ma, han a Baala geya li, a siga Yabaneeli. Na dangi xanbi a sa baa li.<verse eid="JOS 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Baa Xungbe dɛ ra findi na naaninyi nan na sogegorode biri ra. Yudayakae xa naaninyie nan na ki. E xabilɛe birin na mɛnni nɛ.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebi xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Yosuwe naxa Yudayakae xa bɔxi nde fi Yefune xa di Kalebi ma, alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ. A xa taa singe findi Kiriyati Araba nan na, naxan xili Xebiron. Mixi naxan nu xili Araba, na nan lanxi Anaki bɔnsɔɛ benba ma. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kalebi naxa Anaki xa di xɛmɛ saxanyie keri. Nee nu xili nɛ Sɛsayi, Aximan, nun Talama. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Na xanbi e naxa te Debiri xili ma, dɛnnaxɛ nu xili Kiriyati Sifa. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kalebi naxa a fala, «Mixi yo naxan na nɔ Sifa taa ra, n nan n ma di ginɛ Akasa fima nɛ a ma.» <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Kalebi xunya Kenasi xa di xɛmɛ Otiniyeli naxa nɔ Sifa taa ra. Kalebi naxa a xa di ginɛ Akasa fi a ma.<verse eid="JOS 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Akasa to siga Otiniyeli xɔn, a naxa a fala a bɛ a xa bɔxi gbɛtɛ maxɔrin a baba ma. Akasa to goro a xa sofale fari, Kalebi naxa a maxɔrin, «I wama munse xɔn?» <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />A naxa a yaabi, «N wama naxan xɔn, i bara bɔxi fi n ma naxan na yirefanyi biri ra. Yakɔsi i man xa ye yire fan fi n ma.» Awa, a baba naxa geya yire fi a ma. Ye nu na na geya fari, a man nu na geya bunyi.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Yuda xa die kɛ nan yi ki, e xabilɛ ki ma: <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Taa naxee nu na yirefanyi ma, Negewi gbengberenyi ma, Edon naaninyi fɛ ma, e xili Kabaseeli, Ederi, Yaguru, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedesi, Xasori, Yitinan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Sifi, Telemi, Beyaloti, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Xasori Xadata, Keriyoti Xesiron, naxan findixi Xasori ra, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amama, Sema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Xasari Gada, Xesimon, Beti Pɛlɛti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Xasari Suwali, Beriseeba, Bisiyoteya <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baala, Iyimi, Esemi, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Elitoladi, Kesili, Horoma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Sikilaga, Madamanna, Sansanna, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebayoti, Siliximi, Ayin, e nun Rimɔn. E birin nalanxi taa mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomanaani, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Taa naxee nu na Sefela bɔxi, e xili Esetayoli, Soraha, Asena, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Sanowa, En Ganimi, Tapuwa, Enama, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yaramuti, Adulama, Soko, Aseka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Saarayimi, Aditayimi, Gedera, e nun Gederotayimi. E birin nalanxi taa fu nun naani, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Senan, Xadasa, Migidali Gadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dilana, Misipa, Yokatili, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakisi, Bɔsikati, Egilon, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabɔn, Laxamasi, Kitilisi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederoti, Beti Dagɔn, Nama, e nun Makeda. E birin nalanxi taa fu nun senni, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libina, Eteri, Asan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Yifita, Asena, Nesibi, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keyila, Akisibu, nun Maresa. E birin nalanxi taa solomanaani, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ekiron nun a daaxae, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />taa naxee na Ekiron nun Asidodi tagi sogegorode, <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Asidodi nun a daaxae, Gasa nun a daaxae, han Misira xure nun Baa Xungbe naralande.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Taa naxee nu na geya yire, e xili Samiri, Yatiri, Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Danna, Kiriyati Sanna naxan findi Debiri ra, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anaba, Esitemowa, Enama, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gosen, Xolon, Giloka. E birin nalanxi taa fu nun keren, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Arabi, Duma, Eseyan, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Yanimi, Beti Tapuwa, Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Xumeta, Kiriyati Araba naxan findi Xebiron na, e nun Siyoro. E birin nalanxi taa solomanaani, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Mayon, Karemele, Sifi, Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Yisireeli, Yokodeyan, Sanowa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kayin, Gibiya, nun Timina. E birin nalanxi taa fu, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Xalixuli, Beti Suru, Gedori, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maarati, Beti Anoti, nun Elitekon. E birin nalanxi taa senni, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiriyati Bali naxan findi Kiriyati Yeyarimi, nun Raba. E birin nalanxi taa firin, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Taa naxee nu na gbengberen yire, e xili Beti Araba, Midin, Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibisan, Fɔxɔɛ taa, e nun En Gedi. E birin nalanxi taa senni, nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ mu nɔ Yebusukae keride, naxee dɔxɔxi Darisalamu taa kui. Han to e na Yudayakae ya ma.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Efirami nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Bɔxi naxan fi Yusufu xa die ma Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra, a fɔlɔ Yurudɛn xure nan ma Yeriko sogetede biri, Yeriko dulonyi na dɛnnaxɛ. Na naaninyi dangi Yeriko taa nan na, a siga wula i, han a Beteli geya li. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />A keli naa, a siga Lusi han Ataroti taa, Arakakae na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Na xanbi a siga sogegorode biri Yefeletikae yire han Beti Xoron Labe, han Geseri, han Fɔxɛ Ye Baa dɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Yusufu xa die Manasi nun Efirami na nan sɔtɔ kɛ ra.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Efirami xa bɔxi nan ya e xabilɛ ki ma: Naaninyi naxan na fuge ra, a fɔlɔ Ataroti Adari nɛ han Beti Xoron Fuge, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />han a baa dɛ li. A keli Mikimetati kɔɔla ma, a dangi Taanati Silo fuge ra, a siga Yanowa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />A goro han Ataroti nun Naarata. A man dangi Yeriko ra, a sa mini Yurudɛn xure ma. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />A keli Tapuwa, a siga sogegorode biri han Kanna xure, han baa dɛ ra. Efirami bɔnsɔɛ kɛ nan na ki e xabilɛ ki ma. <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ naxa taa nun daaxa ndee fan sɔtɔ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ mu Kanaankae keri Geseri. Han to nee na Efiramikae ya ma, kɔnɔ e findixi konyie nan na.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Yusufu xa di singe Manasi naxa a gbe kɛ sɔtɔ Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. Manasi xa di singe Makiri, naxa findi Galadikae benba ra. A naxa Galadi nun Basan bɔxi sɔtɔ barima geresoe nan nu a ra. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Manasi xa mamadie birin naxa e gbe kɛ sɔtɔ e xabilɛ ki ma. E xilie nan ya: Abiyeseri, Xeleki, Asirɛli, Sikemi, Xeferi, nun Sɛmida. Yusufu xa di Manasi xa die nan na ki, nun e xabilɛe.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Selofexadi, Xeferi xa di, Galadi xa di, Makiri xa di, Manasi xa di mu di xɛmɛ yo bari, fo di ginɛ suuli. E xilie nan ya: Maxala, Nuha, Xogala, Milika, a nun Tirisa. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />E naxa siga sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari, Nunu xa di Yosuwe, nun Isirayila kuntigie xɔn ma, e a fala e bɛ, «Alatala a masen nɛ Annabi Munsa bɛ a xa muxu gbe kɛ fi muxu ma alɔ muxu benba barenyie na a sɔtɔfe ki naxɛ.» Awa Yosuwe naxa e gbe kɛ fi e ma alɔ a a raba e baba xunya xɛmɛmae bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ naxa dɔxɔ fu sɔtɔ, bafe Galadi nun Basan na, naxan na Yurudɛn kiri ma. <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />Manasi xa di ginɛe naxa kɛ sɔtɔ alɔ a xa di xɛmɛe. Galadi bɔxi naxa lu Manasi xa di gbɛtɛe bɛ.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Manasi xa bɔxi naxa fɔlɔ Aseri bɔxi naaninyi ra han Mikimetati taa, naxan na Sikemi sogetede biri ra. A man sigaxi han Yamin naxan na En Tapuwa fɛ ma. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />En Tapuwa xa bɔxi nu findixi Manasikae gbe nan na, kɔnɔ Tapuwa taa naxan nu na naaninyi ra, na tan nu findixi Efirami nan gbe ra. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Na naaninyi nu goroxi han Kanna xure dɛ ra. Manasi xa bɔxi naaninyi findi Kanna xure nan na yirefanyi ma han baa dɛ ra, kɔnɔ Efirami xa taa ndee nu na Manasi xa taae ya ma. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Efirami xa bɔxi nu Kanna xure yirefanyi nan ma. Manasi gbe nu na kɔɔla ma. Baa fan nu findixi e naaninyi nan na. Manasi xa bɔxi kɔɔla ma, nu na Aseri xa bɔxi nan sɛɛti ma. A sogetede biri nu na Isakari xa bɔxi nan sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="JOS 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Manasi naxa taa ndee sɔtɔ Isakari nun Aseri xa bɔxie kui. E xili nan ya: Beti Saan, Yibeleyami, Dɔrɔ, En Dɔrɔ, Taanaki, nun Megido, nun e daaxae. Na saxanyi dɔnxɔɛe nu na Dɔrɔ xa mangɛya nan bun ma. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ mu nɔ na taae ra, Kanaan mixie naxa lu naa. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Kɔnɔ Isirayilakae to sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ, e naxa konyiya dɔxɔ Kanaankae ma, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ e keride.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Yusufu xa die naxa Yosuwe maxɔrin, «I yi bɔxi kerenyi gbansan fixi muxu ma munfe ra? Muxu xabilɛ wuya, barima Alatala bara barakɛ sa muxu xa fe a fanyi ra.» <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yosuwe naxa e yaabi, «Xa wo wuya Efirami geya yire bɛ, wo xa siga Perisikae nun Refakae xa wondi yire, wo mɛnni masɛgɛ alako wo xa bɔxi sɔtɔ.» <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «Yi geyae xurun muxu bɛ. Kanaanka naxee fan sabatixi geyae bunyi, Beti Saan nun e daaxae, naxee na Yisireeli geya bunyi, geresoe ragise wure daaxi na e yi ra.» <verse eid="JOS 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Yosuwe naxa Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ yaabi, «Efiramikae nun Manasikae, wo bara nɔndi fala kɔnɔ wo wuya, wo sɛnbɛ fan gbo. A mu lanma wo xa kɛ dɔxɔde keren gbansan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />Wo na geyae findi wo gbe ra, hali wondi to a ra. Wo naa masɛgɛ alako wo xa na tɔnɛ sɔtɔ. Wo fama Kanaankae keride hali geresoe ragisee wure daaxi nan to na e yi ra.»<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Bɔxi naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Isirayila ɲama to gɛ nɔde bɔxi ra, e naxa e malan Silo, e Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ti naa. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ solofere nu na na tɛmui, naxee mu nu e gbe kɛ sɔtɔxi sinden.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Yosuwe naxa a fala Isirayilakae bɛ, «Wo dɔxɔxi be munfe ra? Munfe ra wo mu sigama wo xa bɔxi tongode wo benbae Marigi Alatala naxan fi wo ma? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Yakɔsi wo xa mixi saxan sugandi bɔnsɔɛ birin ya ma. N xa e xɛɛ, e xa e bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi birin mato, e fa sa na dɛntɛgɛ n bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Na bɔxi xa itaxun dɔxɔ solofere ra. Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa lu na bɔxi yirefanyi ma, Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ fan xa lu na bɔxi kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Wo na gɛ na bɔxi itaxunxi dɔxɔ solofere masende n bɛ, n fama natɛ tongode won Marigi Alatala xa mali saabui ra, alako nee xa itaxun wo ma. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Kɔnɔ Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mu bɔxi yo sɔtɔma, barima e gbe kɛ findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛɲa nan na Alatala bɛ. Gadi, Ruben, a nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe ɲan bara e gbe sɔtɔ Yurudɛn xure kiri ma sogetede biri ra alɔ Annabi Munsa a fi e ma ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Na kui na xɛmɛe naxa siga. Yosuwe nu bara e yamari, «Wo siga, wo bɔxi iɲɛrɛ. Wo xa a mato a na ki naxɛ. Na xanbi wo xa fa be Silo, n xa natɛ tongo won Marigi Alatala xa mali saabui ra, won na bɔxi itaxunma wo ma ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Na xɛmɛe naxa siga bɔxi matode. E taa naxee to na yire solofere kui, e naxa nee birin xilie sɛbɛ, e fa a ra Yosuwe xɔn Silo yonkinde kui. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Yosuwe naxa natɛ tongo Silo Alatala xa mali saabui ra. A naxa na bɔxi birin itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe birin naxa e gbe sɔtɔ Yuda bɔnsɔɛ gbe nun Yusufu xa die gbe tagi Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />E xa naaninyi kɔɔla ma fɔlɔ Yurudɛn xure nan ma, a dangi Yeriko ra kɔɔla biri ra, a te geya ma sogegorode biri ra han a Beti Aweni gbengberenyi li. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />A keli mɛnni, a dangi Lusi ra, naxan man xili Beteli, yirefanyi biri ra. A goro han Ataroti Adari, a te geya fari, naxan na Beti Xoron Labe yirefanyi ma.<verse eid="JOS 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Na naaninyi naxa goro na geya fari a siga baa sɛɛti xɔn ma sigafe ra Kiriyati Bali, naxan man xili Kiriyati Yeyarimi. Na taa findi Yuda xa die nan gbe ra. Naaninyi nan na ki naxan na sogegorode.<verse eid="JOS 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Naxan na yirefanyi ma, a fɔlɔ Kiriyati Yeyarimi nɛ, a siga sogegorode biri ra han a Nefetowa dulonyi li. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Na naaninyi naxa goro mɛnni, a siga han Ben Hinoma geya bunyi ra, Refakae xa gulunba kui kɔɔla mabiri. A keli mɛnni, a goro Ben Hinoma geya bunyi ra, Yebusukae fɛ ma. A yirefanyi ma, a siga han En Rogeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Na naaninyi sigaxi En Semesi kɔɔla biri ra, a siga Geliloti, naxan na Adumimi geya ya ra. A goro han Ruben xa di Bohan xa fanye ma. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />A dangi geya ra kɔɔla biri ra, geya naxan na Yurudɛn gulunba ya tagi. A goro Yurudɛn gulunba kui, <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />a dangi Beti Xogala ra, kɔɔla biri ra. Na yirefanyi naaninyi danxi Yurudɛn xure sode nan ma Fɔxɛ Baa xun.<verse eid="JOS 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Yurudɛn xure findixi Bunyamin xabilɛe xa bɔxi naaninyi nan na sogetede biri ra. Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa naaninyi birin nan na ki.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Taa naxee fi Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe ma, nee nan ya: Yeriko, Beti Xogala, Emeki Kesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Beti Araba, Sɛmarayima, Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Awimi, Para, Ofara, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kefarahamoni, Ofini, nun Geba. Na birin lanxi taa fu nun firin nan ma, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Gabayon, Ramati, Beeroti, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Misipa, Kefira, Mosa, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekemi, Yiripeeli, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Sela, Elefi, Yebusu naxan man xili Darisalamu, Gibiya, a nun Kiriyati Yeyarimi lanxi taa fu nun naani nan ma a nun e daaxae. Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe kɛ nan na ki.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Bɔxi taxun firin nde kui, naxan nabaxi won Marigi Alatala xa mali saabui ra, Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ naxa e gbe kɛ sɔtɔ Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Taa naxee fixi Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ ma, nee nan ya: Beriseeba, Seeba, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Xasari Suwali, Bala, Esemi, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Elitoladi, Bɛtuli, Horoma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Sikilaga, Beti Marakaboti, Xasari Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Beti Lebayoti, a nun Saruxɛn. Na birin lanxi taa fu nun saxan nan ma, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Ayin, Rimɔn, Eteri, nun Asan lanxi taa naani nan ma, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Na daaxae sigama han Baalati Beeri, naxan nu xili Ramati Negewi gbengberenyi ma. Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe kɛ nan na ki. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />E kɛ nu na Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi nan kui, barima bɔxi naxan so Yuda bɔnsɔɛ yi ra, a nu gbo. Nde ba na bɔxi nan na, a naxa so Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ yi ra.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Bɔxi taxun saxan nde naxa findi Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe gbe ra Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. E xa bɔxi naaninyi sigaxi han Saridi, <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />a te Marala sogegorode, han Dabeseti, a man siga xure dɛ ra naxan na Yokanayimi ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />A keli Saridi a a ibilin sogetede biri ra, a Kisiloti Taboro li. A siga han Daberati, han Yafiya. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />A tan na sogetede biri ra, a siga Gati Xeferi nun Eta Kasin. A na Rimɔn li, a siga Neya biri ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Kɔɔla ma, na naaninyi nan sigaxi Xanatɔn han a Yifita Eli gulunba li. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />E man naxa Katati, Nahalali, Simiron, Yidala, nun Bɛtɛlɛɛmu sɔtɔ. Na birin nalanxi taa fu nun firin, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe kɛ nan na ki, e xa taae nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Bɔxi taxun naani nde naxa findi Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe gbe ra Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />E xa naaninyi naxa yi taae birin li: Yisireeli, Kesuloti, Sunemi, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Xafarayimi, Siyon, Anaxarati, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabiti, Kisiyon, Abɛsi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remeti, En Ganimi, En Xada, Beti Pasɛsi, <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Taboro, Saxasima, nun Beti Semesi. Naaninyi danxi Yurudɛn xure dɛ nan na. E birin nalanxi taa fu nun senni, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe kɛ nan na ki, e xa taae nun e daaxae.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Bɔxi taxun suuli nde naxa findi Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe gbe ra Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />E xa naaninyi na yi taae nan na: Xɛlɛkati, Xali, Beten, Akisafa, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alameleki, Amada, nun Misala. E xa naaninyi sogegorode biri na Karemele geya nun Sixori Libanati xure nan na. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />E xa naaninyi sogetede biri fɔlɔxi Beti Dagɔn nɛ, Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ na dɛnnaxɛ, nun Yifita Eli gulunba. A siga kɔɔla ma Beti Emeki nun Neyiyeli. A dangi Kabulu ra kɔɔla biri ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />A naxa siga Abadon, Rexobo, Xamɔn, nun Kanna, han Sidɔn taa xungbe. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Naaninyi keli Sidɔn, a siga Ramati nun Tire taa makantaxi mabiri. A siga Xosa, a mini Fɔxɛ Ye Baa ma Akisibu bɔxi ma, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Uma, Afeki, nun Rexobo taae. E birin lanma taa mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin nan ma, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Yi taae nun daaxae birin findixi Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe kɛ nan na.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Bɔxi taxun senni nde naxa findi Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe gbe ra Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Na bɔxi naaninyi naxa fɔlɔ Xelefa taa ma, a siga wuri bili belebele nde ma naxan na Saananimi. A dangi Adami Nekebi nun Yabaneeli ra, a Lakuma li, a siga han Yurudɛn xure dɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Na naaninyi naxa siga sogegorode biri ra han a Asanoti Taboro li, a sa mini Hulɔku taa ma. A Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi li yirefanyi ma, a Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi li sogegorode biri ra. A Yurudɛn xure li sogetede biri ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Taae nan ya tɛtɛ hagigɛe nu soxi naxee ra: Sidima, Sere, Xamata, Rakati, Kinereti, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama, Ramati, Xasori, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedesi, Edereyi, En Xasori, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yirɔn, Migidali Eli, Xoremi, Beti Anati, Beti Semesi. Na birin lanxi taa fu nun solomanaani nan ma, a nun e daaxae. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe kɛ nan na ki.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dana bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Bɔxi taxun solofere nde naxa findi Dana bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛe gbe ra Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />E xa bɔxi naaninyi na yi taae nan na: Soraha, Esetayoli, Iri Semesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Saalabin, Ayalon, Yitila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Elon, Timina, Ekiron, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Eliteke, Gibɛtɔn, Baalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Yehudu, Beneberaki, Gati Rimɔn, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Yarakɔn dulonyi, Rakɔn, nun bɔxi naxan na Yafa ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Kɔnɔ na bɔxi kanyie man naxa gbilen e xa bɔxi ma. Na kui Dana bɔnsɔɛ naxa siga Lesemi gerede. E naxa naa masɔtɔ, e mɛnnikae faxa santidɛgɛma ra. E sabati mɛnni, e fa e baba Dana xili sa naa xun. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Yi taae nun daaxae birin findixi Dana xabilɛe kɛ nan na.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe xa bɔxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />E to gɛ e xa bɔxi itaxunde, e naxa Nunu xa di Yosuwe kɛ fi a ma e tagi Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Yosuwe taa naxan maxɔrin e ma, Timina Sera, e naxa na fi a ma alɔ Alatala a masen e bɛ ki naxɛ. Na taa na Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa geya bɔxi nan kui. Yosuwe naxa taa ragbilen a nɛɛnɛ ra, a sabati naa. <verse eid="JOS 19:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari, Yosuwe, nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛ kuntigie bɔxi itaxun Alatala xa mali saabui ra na ki nɛ, a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira naadɛ ra naxan nu na Silo.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Yɛtɛ ratanga taae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Alatala naxa a masen Yosuwe bɛ, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />«A fala Isirayilakae bɛ e xa taa ndee sugandi mixie ratangama dɛnnaxɛ, alɔ n a fala Annabi Munsa bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Xa mixi nde sa a boore nde faxa, kɔnɔ a fa a li a mu a rakelixi a ma, a xa a gi, a siga na taa nde a ratangama gbeɲɔxɔɛ ti ma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />A na na taa li tɛmui naxɛ, a xa ti naa sode dɛ ra, a fa a dɛntɛgɛ forie bɛ. Nee xa a raso taa kui, e a yigiya e xɔnyi. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Xa gbeɲɔxɔɛ ti sa siga naa, e naxa na faxɛti so a yi ra de, barima na faxɛ mu kelixi ɲanige xa ma. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Faxɛti xa lu na taa kui han a xa makiiti mɛnnikae ya xɔri. E xa a lu na taa kui han sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi faxama tɛmui naxɛ. Na xanbi na mixi xa gbilen a xɔnyi, a kelixi dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />E naxa yi taae sugandi: Kedesi naxan na Galile bɔxi ma Nafatali geyae na dɛnnaxɛ, Sikemi naxan na Efirami geyae fari, Kiriyati Araba naxan xili Xebiron, naxan na Yudaya geyae ma. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />E naxa taa gbɛtɛe fan sugandi Yurudɛn xure kiri ma sogetede biri ra: Beteseri, naxan na Ruben xa gbengberenyi ma, Ramoti naxan na Galadi bɔxi ma, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ na dɛnnaxɛ, Golan naxan na Basan bɔxi ma, Manasi bɔnsɔɛ na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Taae nan na ki naxee sugandixi Isirayilakae nun e xa xɔɲɛe bɛ, alako naxan na mixi faxa, kɔnɔ a mu a rakelixi a ma, a xa a yɛtɛ ratanga gbeɲɔxɔɛ ti ma mɛɛni. Na kui mixi mu faxama gbeɲɔxɔɛ ti saabui ra, beenun ɲama xa a makiiti.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa taae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ kuntigie naxa siga sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari, Nunu xa di Yosuwe, nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xabilɛ kuntigie xɔn ma Silo taa kui Kanaan bɔxi ma. <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />E sa a fala e bɛ, «Alatala a masen nɛ nu Annabi Munsa bɛ a muxu xa taae sɔtɔ muxu sabatima dɛnnaxɛ, a nun muxu xa fiilie fan sɔtɔ muxu xa xurusee bɛ.» <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Na kui Isirayilakae naxa yi taae nun yi fiilie fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma, e xa findi e kɛ ra alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Kehati xabilɛ gbe nan ya: Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Haruna xa die naxa taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa taae ya ma, Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Kehati xabilɛ, naxee nu luxi, nee naxa taa fu sɔtɔ Efirami bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, Dana bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti boore gbee ya ma. Na natɛ birin tongoxi Ala xa maragiri saabui ra.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Gerison xa die naxa taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ Isakari bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, Aseri bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, a nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe naxan na Basan bɔxi ma, na gbee ya ma. Na natɛ birin tongoxi Ala xa maragiri saabui ra.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Merari xa die naxa taa fu nun firin sɔtɔ e xabilɛ ki ma Ruben bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma, nun Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ gbee ya ma. Na natɛ birin tongoxi Ala xa maragiri saabui ra.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Na kui Isirayilakae naxa yi taae nun e fiilie fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma alɔ Alatala a yamari ki naxɛ Annabi Munsa saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Taa naxee fixi e ma Yuda nun Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, nee nan ya. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Haruna xa die gbe, naxee keli Kehati xabilɛ, nee naxa yi taae sɔtɔ Ala xa maragiri saabui ra sugandi singe kui: <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Kiriyati Araba, naxan findi Xebiron na, a nun fiili naxee na Yudaya geya bɔxi rabilinyi ma. Araba findi Anakie benba nan na. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Daaxae nun taa xunxuri naxee na taa fari ma nee findi Yefune xa di Kalebi gbee nan na.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />E taa naxee fi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Haruna xa die ma, nee nan yi ki: Xebiron, mixi ratanga taa nde, Libina, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Yatiri, Esitemowa, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Xolon, Debiri, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Ayin, Yuta, nun Beti Semesi, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa solomanaani, kelife yi bɔnsɔɛ firinyi ma.<verse eid="JOS 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />E naxa yi taae sɔtɔ Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui: Gabayon, Geba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatɔti, Alamɔn, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Haruna xa die naxa taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ, nun e fiilie.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Lewika naxee kelixi Kehati xa di booree ya ma, Ala xa maragiri naxa a niya nee naxa taae sɔtɔ Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Na taae nan ya: Sikemi naxan na Efirami geya bɔxi fari, mixi nɔma ratangade gbeɲɔxɔɛ ti ma dɛnnaxɛ, Geseri, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibisayimi, Beti Xoron, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />E naxee sɔtɔ Dana xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Eliteke, Gibɛtɔn, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Ayalon, Gati Rimɔn, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />E naxee sɔtɔ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti boore xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Taanaki, Gati Rimɔn, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa firin. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Yi taa fu nun e fiilie naxa findi Kehati xa die xabilɛe gbe ra naxee mu nu na Haruna xa die ya ma.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Gerison xabilɛe naxa taae sɔtɔ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe ya ma. E xili Golan, mixi ratanga taa nde naxan na Basan bɔxi ma, Bɛsɛtɛra, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa firin. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />E naxee sɔtɔ Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Kisiyon, Daberati, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Yaramuti, Ganimi, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />E naxee sɔtɔ Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Misala, Abadon, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Xɛlɛkati, Rexobo, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />E naxee sɔtɔ Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Kedesi, mixi ratanga taa nde naxan na Galile bɔxi kui nun a fiilie, Xamɔti Dɔrɔ nun a fiilie, Karatan nun a fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa saxan.<verse eid="JOS 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Gerison xabilɛe naxa taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ nun e fiilie. <verse eid="JOS 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Lewikae naxee luxi, Merari xabilɛe ra, e naxee sɔtɔ Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, nee nan ya: Yokanayimi, Karata, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimina, Nahalali, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />E naxee sɔtɔ Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Beteseri, Yahasi, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemoti, Mefaati, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />E naxee sɔtɔ Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi kui, nee nan ya: Ramoti, mixi ratanga taa nde naxan na Galadi bɔxi kui, Maxanayimi, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Xɛsibɔn, Yaasɛri, nun e fiilie. Na birin nalanxi taa naani. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Taa naxee birin fixi Merari xabilɛe ma, e ralanxi taa fu nun firin. <verse eid="JOS 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Taa naxee birin fixi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma Isirayilakae xa bɔxi kui, e ralanxi taa tongo naani nun solomasaxan, nun e rabilinyie. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Fiilie nu na taae birin nabilinxi.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Alatala naxa na bɔxi birin fi Isirayilakae ma alɔ a a laayidi e benbae bɛ ki naxɛ. Na bɔxi birin naxa findi e gbe ra, e naxa sabati naa. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Alatala naxa bɔɲɛsa fi e ma e naaninyi birin na, alɔ a a laayidi e benbae bɛ ki naxɛ. E yaxui yo mu nɔ xunnakeli sɔtɔde e xun, barima Alatala e yaxui birin sa nɛ e sagoe. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Alatala xa laayidi birin naxa kamali Isirayilakae bɛ. Keren mu lu naxan mu kamali.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛbade yailanxi Yurudɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Na tɛmui Yosuwe naxa Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe xili. <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />A a fala e bɛ, «Alatala xa konyi Munsa fe naxan birin fala wo bɛ, wo bara na birin naba. Wo man bara bira n xui birin fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Wo mu wo ngaxakerenyie rabɛɲin yi xi wuyaxie bun ma han to. Wo Marigi Alatala yaamari naxan so wo yi ra, wo bara wo ɲɛngi sa a xɔn ma. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Yakɔsi wo Marigi Alatala bara malabui fi wo ngaxakerenyie ma, alɔ a a masen e bɛ ki naxɛ. Yakɔsi wo siga wo xɔnyi. Wo xa gbilen na bɔxi ma Alatala xa konyi Munsa dɛnnaxɛ soxi wo yi ra Yurudɛn kiri ma. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Wo xa mɛɛni yi sɛriyɛ nun yi yaamari rabafe ma, Alatala xa konyi Munsa naxan soxi wo yi ra. Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xanu, wo xa bira a xa kira birin fɔxɔ ra, wo xa wo ɲɛngi sa a xa yaamari xɔn wo ɲanige fiixɛ ra nun wo nii birin na.»<verse eid="JOS 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Yosuwe naxa duba e bɛ, e fa siga e xɔnyi. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Annabi Munsa nu bara kɛ so Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren yi ra Basan. Yosuwe fan naxa kɛ so yi sɛɛti boore yi ra e ngaxakerenyie fɛ ma Yurudɛn sogegorode. Yosuwe to nu e rasigama e xɔnyi, a naxa duba e bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />A naxɛ e bɛ, «Wo nun harige gbegbe xa gbilen wo xɔnyi, nun xurusee, gbeti, xɛɛma, yɔxui, wure, nun dugie. Wo nun wo ngaxakerenyie xa wo yaxuie harige itaxun wo wo wasasoxi naxee.»<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe naxa gbilen. E naxa keli Isirayilakae xun ma Silo, Kanaan bɔxi ma, e siga Galadi bɔxi ma, bɔxi naxan findi e gbe ra Alatala xa yaamari bun ma Annabi Munsa saabui ra. <verse eid="JOS 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />E to so Yurudɛn nabilinyi Kanaan bɔxi ma, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe naxa sɛrɛxɛbade belebele yailan Yurudɛn xure dɛ ra.<verse eid="JOS 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Isirayilakae to na mɛ, e naxa a fala, «Wo bara a to, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe bara sɛrɛxɛbade yailan Kanaan bɔxi ma, Yurudɛn taae kui Isirayilakae fɛ ma.» <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Isirayilakae to na fe kolon, e birin naxa e malan Silo alako e xa te e gerede.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Isirayilakae naxa Finexasi, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari xa di xɛɛ Galadi bɔxi ma, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe xɔn. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Mangɛ fu, bɔnsɔɛ yo bɔnsɔɛ mangɛ keren, naxa a mati. Nee birin nu findixi e xabilɛ xunyie nan na Isirayilakae wulu wulu tagi.<verse eid="JOS 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />E naxa siga Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe yire, Galadi bɔxi ma. Finexasi naxa a fala e bɛ, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />«Alatala xa ɲama birin yi nan masenxi, ‹Wo Isirayila Marigi Ala yanfaxi munfe ra? To, wo gbilenxi Alatala fɔxɔ ra munfe ra? Wo sɛrɛxɛbade yailanxi munfe ra, naxan findixi Alatala matandife ra? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Won fe ɲaaxi naxan naba Peyori, han to won na na tɔɔrɛ nan kui yi ki. Hali Alatala to ɲaxankatɛ dɔxɔ a xa ɲama birin ma na fe ma, han to won mu nu sɛniyɛn sinden. <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />To, wo bara muruta wo Marigi Alatala ma. Xa wo Alatala matandima to, tina a xa xɔnɛ fama nɛ dusude Isirayila ɲama nan birin xun ma. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Na kui, bɔxi naxan findi wo gbe ra, xa na mu sɛniyɛnxi, wo xa gbilen Alatala xa bɔxi ma, alako wo xa wo yɛtɛ bɔxi sɔtɔ muxu tagi. Kɔnɔ wo naxa Alatala nun Isirayilakae matandi sɛrɛxɛbade yailanfe ra de, naxan mu findixi won Marigi Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade ra. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Sera xa di Akan to tinxintareya raba se ratɔnxie ra, see ra a mu lan naxee xa tongo, Alatala naxa xɔnɔ Isirayilakae birin ma. A keren xa mu halaki a xa yunubi rabaxi ma.›»<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe naxa Isirayila mangɛe yaabi, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />«Marigi Alatala, a tan nan na Mangɛ Ala ra! A tan nan a kolon muxu yi rabaxi fe naxan ma. Isirayilaka birin fan fama a kolonde. Xa muxu bara Alatala matandi, xa muxu bara tinxintareya raba, muxu naxa kisi to lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Xa muxu sɛrɛxɛbade yailanxi muxu yɛtɛ nan bɛ, alako muxu xa gbilen muxu Marigi Alatala fɔxɔ ra, muxu xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi, sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi, nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ba, Alatala yɛtɛ yati nan fama muxu makiitide.»<verse eid="JOS 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />«Kɔnɔ na mɔɔli xa mu a ra. Muxu yi rabaxi nɛ barima muxu nu bara kɔntɔfili, tina wo xa die nɔma nɛ a falade muxu xa die bɛ, ‹Dari mundun na wo tan nun Isirayila Marigi Alatala tagi? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Alatala Yurudɛn nan findixi won naaninyi ra. Ruben bɔnsɔɛ nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, wo gbe yo mu na Alatala gbe ya ma.› Muxu xa die bama nɛ gaaxufe Alatala ya ra wo xa die saabui ra.»<verse eid="JOS 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />«Na kui muxu naxa a fala, won fan xa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan. Sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun sɛrɛxɛ mɔɔli gbɛtɛ yo mu bama na, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />kɔnɔ na xa findi seede ra wo tan nun muxu tan tagi, wo bɔnsɔɛ nun muxu bɔnsɔɛ tagi hali won tan dangi xanbi, muxu Alatala rabatuma sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi, sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi, nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ya ra. Na tɛmui wo xa die naxa fa sa a fala muxu xa die bɛ, ‹Wo gbe yo mu na Alatala gbe ya ma.› <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Muxu bara a fala, tina, xa e sa na wɔyɛnyi fala muxu bɛ, xa na mu muxu xa die bɛ, muxu fan e yaabima nɛ, ‹Wo Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade kɛɲa mato, muxu babae naxan yailanxi. Sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun sɛrɛxɛ mɔɔli gbɛtɛ yo mu bama naa, kɔnɔ na xa findi seede ra wo tan nun muxu tan tagi.› <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Ala xa muxu tanga muxu bɔɲɛ ratefe ra Alatala xili ma. A xa muxu tanga muxu gbilenfe ra a fɔxɔ ra to lɔxɔɛ sɛrɛxɛbade yailanfe ra, sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie, sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexie, nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe bama dɛnnaxɛ. Nee bama won Marigi Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade gbansan nɛ, naxan na won Marigi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ya ra.»<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Finexasi, mangɛdie nun Isirayila wulu wulu mangɛe to yi masenyi mɛ, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe naxan masenxi, e bɔɲɛ naxa rafan e ma. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari xa di Finexasi naxa a masen Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti singe bɛ, «Muxu bara a kolon Alatala na won ya ma to lɔxɔɛ, barima wo mu tinxintareya rabaxi Alatala ra. Wo bara Isirayilakae ratanga Alatala bɛlɛxɛ i.»<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Eleyasari xa di Finexasi nun mangɛe naxa keli Galadi bɔxi ma, Ruben, nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nu na dɛnnaxɛ, e gbilen Kanaan bɔxi ma Isirayilakae yire, e dɛntɛgɛ sa e bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Yi dɛntɛgɛ naxa rafan Isirayilakae ma, e naxa Ala tantu. Gere sofe, e xa Ruben nun Gadi xa bɔxi sɔntɔ, na maɲɔxunyi mu lu e yi sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JOS 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Ruben nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ naxa yi xili sa na sɛrɛxɛbade xun ma: «A tan nan na won tagi seede ra a Alatala nan na Ala ra.»<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Yosuwe xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Tɛmui gbegbe dangi nɛ kafi Alatala naxa malabui fi Isirayila ɲama ma, a ratangafe a yaxuie ma a rabilinyi. Yosuwe nu bara fori, a xa simaya nu bara bu. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Na kui Yosuwe naxa Isirayila birin malan, a forie, a mangɛe, a kiitisae, nun a sɔɔri mangɛe. A naxa a fala e bɛ, «N bara fori, n ma simaya bara a ikuya. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Wo bara a to wo Marigi Alatala fe naxan birin nabaxi yi sie ra wo xa fe ra. Wo Marigi Alatala nan gere soxi wo bɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />«Wo a mato, n bara kɛ bɔxi so wo yi ra, Ala naxan ɲanigexi wo bɔnsɔɛe bɛ. Na bɔxi birin, sie gbɛtɛe nu dɛnnaxɛ, nun dɛnnaxɛ suxu daaxi luxi, Yurudɛn nun Baa Xungbe longori sogegorode, n bara na birin itaxun wo ma. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Wo Marigi Alatala e makuyama nɛ wo ra pon, a e faxa wo ya ra, wo fa e xa bɔxi tongo alɔ wo Marigi Alatala a masen wo bɛ ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JOS 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />«Wo wo sɛnbɛ so. Wo xa wo mɛɛni sɛriyɛ birin nabatufe ma naxan sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa kui. Wo naxa binya yirefanyi ma, wo naxa binya kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Wo naxa sunbu yi sie ra, naxee luxi wo ya ma. Wo naxa e xa alae maxandi, wo naxa wo kali e xili ra. Wo naxa e batu, wo naxa wo tuubi e bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Kɔnɔ wo tan xa wo tagi ixiri wo Marigi Alatala xa fe ra, alɔ wo bara fa a raba ra ki naxɛ han to.»<verse eid="JOS 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />«Alatala bara si gbangbalanyi sɛnbɛmae halaki wo ya ra, keli na ma, han to, mixi keren mu nɔxi tide wo ya ra. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Wo ya ma, mixi keren nu mixi wulu nan kerima, barima wo Marigi Alatala nan nu gere soma wo bɛ alɔ a a laayidi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Wo xa wo ɲɛngi sa wo yɛtɛ kan xɔn ma a fanyi ra, wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xanu.»<verse eid="JOS 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />«Kɔnɔ xa wo wo kobe ti wo Marigi Alatala ra, wo naxa bira si gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra naxee luxi wo ya ma, wo naxa sunbu e ra, wo naxa e xa di ginɛe dɔxɔ, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />wo xa a kolon wo Marigi Alatala mu fama yi sie ragide wo ya ra sɔnɔn. E findima wo bɛ yɛlɛ nun gantanyi nan na, e findi luxusinyi ra wo fari, e findi tunbe ra wo ya kui, han wo birin gɛ halakide yi bɔxi fanyi ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma.»<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />«A gbe mu luxi n xa faxa alɔ nimase birin naxee na duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari. Wo xa a kolon wo bɔɲɛ kui, wo nii birin na, wo Marigi Alatala laayidi yo naxan tongoxi wo bɛ, na mu kanama. A xa laayidi birin bara kamali, keren mu kanaxi. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Wo xa a kolon wo Marigi Alatala a xa laayidi fanyi rakamalixi ki naxɛ, a man fama a xa laayidi ɲaxankatɛ daaxi rakamalide na ki nɛ, han a gɛ wo halakide yi bɔxi fanyi ma a dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Xa wo tondi yi saatɛ rakamalide wo Marigi Alatala wo yamarixi naxan na, xa wo wo tuubi ala gbɛtɛe bɛ, wo naxa wo felen e bɛ, Alatala xɔnɔma nɛ wo ma, wo fa halaki, a wo ralɔɛ yi bɔxi fanyi ma, a dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma.»<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Malanyi dɔnxɔɛ Sikemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Yosuwe naxa Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin malan Sikemi, a fa Isirayila forie, a mangɛe, a kiitisae, nun a sɔɔri mangɛe maxili, e birin naxa sa e yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛ Ala bɛ. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yosuwe naxa a masen ɲama birin bɛ, «Isirayila Marigi Alatala xui nan ya, ‹Wo benba Tera nun a xa die Iburahima nun Naxori nu sabatixi kafi tɛmui xɔnkuye xure kiri ma, e nu ala gbɛtɛe nan batuma. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />N naxa wo baba Iburahima tongo xure kiri ma, muxu naxa Kanaan bɔxi birin isa, n fa a bɔnsɔɛ iwuya. N naxa a xa di Isiyaga fi a ma, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />n fa a niya Isiyaga xa a xa die Yaxuba nun Esayu bari. N naxa Seyiri geya bɔxi so Esayu yi ra, kɔnɔ Yaxuba nun a xa die tan naxa goro Misira bɔxi ma.›»<verse eid="JOS 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />«N naxa Munsa nun Haruna xɛɛ Misira bɔxi ma, n fa ɲaxankatɛ wuyaxi dɔxɔ Misirakae ma e saabui ra. Na kui n naxa wo ramini Misira ra. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />N to wo babae ramini, Misirakae naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra han Xulunyumi Baa dɛ ra. E bakixi sɔɔri ragisee nun soe fari. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Wo babae to gbelegbele Alatala ra, a naxa dimi rasin e nun Misirakae tagi. Misirakae to bira wo babae fɔxɔ ra baa tagi, Alatala naxa baa radin e xun ma. Wo yae bara na birin to, a naxan nabaxi Misirakae ra. Na dangi xanbi, wo naxa tɛmui xɔnkuye raba gbengberenyi ma.»<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />«N naxa wo xanin Amorikae xa bɔxi ma dɛnnaxɛ na Yurudɛn kiri ma. E naxa wo gere, kɔnɔ n naxa e sa wo bɛlɛxɛ i, n e keri wo ya ra, wo fa e xa bɔxi masɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Siporo xa di Balaki, naxan findixi Mowaba mangɛ ra, a fan naxa keli a xa Isirayila gere. A naxa Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami xili, alako a xa wo danka, <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />kɔnɔ n to mu wa n tuli matife na dankɛ ra, Balami xa wɔyɛnyi naxa mafindi, a fa duba wo bɛ. Na kui n naxa wo ba a bɛlɛxɛ i.»<verse eid="JOS 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />«Wo to Yurudɛn igiri, wo naxa Yeriko li. Yerikokae naxa wo gere, alɔ Amorikae, Perisikae, Kanaankae, Xitikae, Girigasakae, Hiwikae, nun Yebusukae fan nabaxi ki naxɛ, kɔnɔ n naxa e birin sa wo bɛlɛxɛ i. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />N fa ɲuri nde radin Amori mangɛ firinyie ma wo ya ra. A naxa e keri, kɔnɔ na mu findi wo yɛtɛ xa santidɛgɛma nun wo xa xali ra. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />N bɔxi nan fixi wo ma wo mu naxee rawalixi. N taae nan fixi wo ma, wo mu naxee tixi. N wɛni bilie nun oliwi bilie nan fixi wo ma, wo mu naxee sixi. Wo na balofe nee nan xun na yi ki.»<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />«Yakɔsi wo xa gaaxu Alatala ya ra, wo xa a rabatu ɲanige fanyi nun tinxinyi ra. Wo xa gbilen na alae fɔxɔ ra wo babae naxee batuxi xure kiri ma nun Misira bɔxi ma. Wo xa Alatala batu! <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Xa wo mu tinma na ra, wo xa natɛ tongo wo alae naxee batuma, alɔ Amorikae xa alae e naxee batuma yi bɔxi ma, xa na mu alae wo babae nu naxee batuma xure kiri ma. Kɔnɔ wo xa a kolon a n tan nun n ma denbaya, muxu Alatala nan batuma.»<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Ɲama naxa a yaabi yi wɔyɛnyie ra, «Na xaxili makuya muxu ra gbilenfe ra Alatala fɔxɔ ra, muxu mu nɔma birade ala gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />barima Alatala nan na won Marigi Ala ra. A tan nan muxu ramini Misira bɔxi ra, konyiya kui, muxu tan nun muxu babae. A gere so nɛ muxu bɛ muxu ya xɔri yi kaabanako belebelee ra. A naxa muxu kanta muxu xa ɲɛrɛ birin kui, nun ɲamae tagi muxu dangixi naxee birin na. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Alatala bara ɲama birin keri muxu ya ra, a nun Amorikae naxee sabatixi yi bɔxi ma. Muxu tan fan Alatala nan batuma, barima a tan nan na muxu Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Yosuwe naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo mu nɔma Alatala batude, barima Alatala sɛniyɛn, Ala tɔɔnɛxi na a ra. A mu diɲɛma wo xa matandi nun wo xa yunubi ma. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Xa wo Alatala finsiriwali birafe ala gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra, a gbilenma nɛ a xa fe fanyie fɔxɔ ra a nu naxee rabama wo bɛ, a fa gbaloe ramini wo ma, han a wo raɲɔn.»<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Ɲama naxa a fala Yosuwe bɛ, «Ade, muxu Alatala nan batuma.» <verse eid="JOS 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Yosuwe naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo bara findi wo yɛtɛ kan ma seedee ra. Wo tan nan yɛtɛ yati Alatala sugandixi alako wo xa a batu.» E naxa Yosuwe yaabi, «Muxu bara findi seedee ra.» <verse eid="JOS 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Yosuwe man naxa a fala e bɛ, «Yakɔsi wo xa gbilen ala gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra, naxee na wo tagi. Wo xa wo xaxili ti Alatala ra, Isirayila Marigi Ala.» <verse eid="JOS 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ɲama naxa a fala Yosuwe bɛ, «Muxu muxu Marigi Alatala nan batuma, muxu a xui rabatu.»<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Yosuwe nun ɲama naxa saata. A naxa sɛriyɛ nun yaamarie so ɲama yi ra Sikemi. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Yosuwe naxa yi fe birin sɛbɛ Ala xa Sɛriyɛ Kitaabui kui. A naxa gɛmɛ belebele tongo, a naxa a ti wuri tofanyi bun ma naxan nu na Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira yire. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Yosuwe fa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo bara yi gɛmɛ to? A findima won bɛ seede nan na, barima a bara wɔyɛnyi birin mɛ, Alatala naxan masenxi won bɛ. A findima seede nan na won bɛ, alako wo naxa wo kobe so wo Marigi Alatala ra.» <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Na kui Yosuwe naxa ɲama lu, e birin naxa siga e xa bɔxi ma dɛnnaxɛ findi e kɛ ra.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe xa saya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Yi fe to dangi, Nunu xa di Yosuwe, Alatala xa konyi, naxa laaxira a xa simaya ɲɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛ fu ma. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />A naxa ragata bɔxi ma a kɛ naxan na, Timina Sera, Efirami geyae biri ra, Gaasi geya kɔɔla biri ra. <verse eid="JOS 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Isirayila Alatala batu nɛ Yosuwe xa simaya birin kui, a nun forie xa simaya birin kui, Yosuwe singe faxa naxee bɛ, naxee nu fe birin kolon Alatala naxan naba Isirayilakae bɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Isirayilakae Yusufu xɔri naxee xanin e xun ma keli Misira, e sa e ragata Sikemi bɔxi nan ma, Yaxuba bɔxi naxan sara Xamori xa die ma, Sikemi baba ma, mɛnnikae xa kɔbiri kole kɛmɛ ra. Na bara findi Yusufu xa die kɛ ra. <verse eid="JOS 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Haruna xa di Eleyasari fan naxa faxa. E naxa a ragata a xa di Finexasi xa geya fari, dɛnnaxɛ nu bara findi a kɛ ra Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma geya longori.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>